  "当 \\(K/P\\to0\\) 时，低模只接收至多 \\(O(K/P)\\) 比例；主要交换发生在两个相近高频腿之间。 这就是“非局部三波中的局部传递”。": "When \\(K/P\\to0\\), low modes receive at most \\(O(K/P)\\) proportion; the main exchange occurs between two nearly high-frequency legs. This is \"local transfer within nonlocal triads\".",
