  "非局部三波确实较小，但这还不能解决千禧年问题。 余下的困难在相近尺度的有限宽对角带，以及其中不同螺旋和相位类别的净效应。": "Nonlocal triads are indeed small, but this is not yet sufficient to resolve the millennium problem. The remaining difficulties lie in finite-width near-diagonal bands at similar scales and their net effects among different helical and phase categories.",
