  "该命题可由上一节的逐块界经有限重叠和 \\(\\ell^2\\) Cauchy–Schwarz 直接得到； 若只假设 \\(u\\in\\dot H^{1/2}\\cap\\dot H^{3/2}\\)，可用光滑逼近延拓。": "This proposition can be directly obtained from the block bounds of the previous section via finite overlap and \\(\\ell^2\\) Cauchy–Schwarz; if only assuming \\(u\\in\\dot H^{1/2}\\cap\\dot H^{3/2}\\), smooth approximations can be used for extension.",
  "高频与输出 \\(\\simeq j\\)，低频 \\(r\\le j-M\\)": "High frequency with output \\(\\simeq j\\), low frequency \\(r\\le j-M\\)",
  "更细结构：": "Finer structure:",
  "构造单壳/双壳无散三角多项式，数值搜索临界三线性比值的近极值器，再用区间界或符号代数复核。": "Construct single-shell and double-shell divergence-free trigonometric polynomials, search numerically for near-extremizers of the critical trilinear ratio, and then check them with interval bounds or symbolic algebra.",
  "固定一个足够大的整数 \\(M\\)，把指标区分为：": "Fix a sufficiently large integer \\(M\\), and classify the indices as:",
  "合并命题：远离对角线的部分可吸收": "the off-diagonal part can be absorbed",
  "将非线性写成 \\(\\mathcal N_{1/2}=R_M+N_M^{near}\\)。远程尾虽小，但近对角部分仍只有": "Write the nonlinearity as \\(\\mathcal N_{1/2}=R_M+N_M^{near}\\). Although the remote tails are small, the near-diagonal parts still have only",
  "接下来可以把注意力放在有限宽的近对角带上。异号高频螺旋说明，普遍的非局部抵消估计并不成立。 这些计算没有给出大数据全局先验界，也没有证明 Clay 问题所要求的全局光滑性。": "Next, one can focus on a finite-width near-diagonal band. Opposite-sign high-frequency helical structures indicate that the general nonlocal cancellation estimate does not hold in general. These calculations do not provide a global a priori bound in the large-data regime and do not prove the required global smoothness as demanded by the Clay problem.",
  "结构来源": "Structural origin",
  "近对角临界项": "high/low frequency near-diagonal critical term",
  "近对角区仍然没有小因子；必须研究相近尺度的精确几何系数、相位锁定、 helicity 类别之间的净抵消，或构造证明这些增益不存在的近极值场。": "near-diagonal region still lacks small factors; one must study the net cancellation among precise geometric coefficients of nearly matched scales, phase locking, helicity categories, or construct a near extremal field to prove that these gains do not exist.",
  "局部性计算，不是正则性定理": "locality calculation, not regularity theorem",
  "利用邻壳卷积在 \\(\\ell^2\\) 上有界，两个远程部分均满足 \\(|R_M^{LH}|+|R_M^{HL}|\\le C2^{-2M}AB^2\\)。": "using neighbor shell convolution on \\(\\ell^2\\) is bounded; both remote parts satisfy \\(|R_M^{LH}|+|R_M^{HL}|\\le C2^{-2M}AB^2\\).",
  "两个守恒量把八类耦合分成两种非局部行为": "two conserved quantities divide eight classes of coupling into two nonlocal behaviors",
  "临界 \\(\\dot H^{1/2}\\) 三线性项的尺度分离部分确定性可求和； 分离 \\(M\\) 壳至少得到 \\(2^{-2M}\\) 小因子。": "the critical scaling of the trilinear term \\(\\dot H^{1/2}\\) in \\(M\\) can be summed; separation \\(2^{-2M}\\) yields at least a small factor.",
  "令 \\(u_{\\le j-M}=\\sum_{r\\le j-M}u_r\\)，\\(\\widetilde u_j\\) 是包住输出壳的有限邻壳和， 使 \\(\\Delta_j\\widetilde u_j=u_j\\)。于是": "let \\(u_{\\le j-M}=\\sum_{r\\le j-M}u_r\\), \\(\\widetilde u_j\\) be the finite neighbor shell enveloping the output shell, such that \\(\\Delta_j\\widetilde u_j=u_j\\). Thus",
