  "且没有与 \\(A\\) 无关的统一小系数。选择更大的 \\(M\\) 可以压低远程尾，却同时把更多三波放进近对角集合； 它不能把 \\(C A B^2\\) 变成可由 \\(\\nu B^2\\) 对任意大 \\(A\\) 吸收的估计。": "and there is no uniform small coefficient unrelated to \\(A\\). Choosing larger \\(M\\) can suppress remote tails but simultaneously puts more three-waves into the near-diagonal set; it cannot make the estimate \\(C A B^2\\) absorbable by estimates using \\(\\nu B^2\\) for any large \\(A\\).",
