  "同号高频螺旋的低模能量率受 \\(K/P\\) 抑制； 异号高频螺旋并不受此抑制。": "the low-mode energy rate of same-sign high-frequency helical is inhibited by \\(K/P\\); opposite-sign high-frequency helical is not inhibited.",
  "同号高频螺旋压低低模传递；异号高频螺旋没有这个因子。": "same-sign high-frequency helical suppresses low-mode transfer; opposite-sign high-frequency helical does not have this factor.",
  "同一脚本核对 dyadic \\(\\ell^2\\) 尾： \\(\\big(\\sum_{n\\ge M}2^{-4n}\\big)^{1/2}\\) 每增加一壳乘 \\(1/4\\)， \\(\\big(\\sum_{n\\ge M}2^{-6n}\\big)^{1/2}\\) 每增加一壳乘 \\(1/8\\)。": "the same script kernel for dyadic \\(\\ell^2\\) tails: \\(\\big(\\sum_{n\\ge M}2^{-4n}\\big)^{1/2}\\) increases by one shell multiplied by \\(1/4\\), and \\(\\big(\\sum_{n\\ge M}2^{-6n}\\big)^{1/2}\\) increases by one shell multiplied by \\(1/8\\).",
  "为什么这仍然不闭合大数据": "why this still does not close in the large-data regime",
  "我把 R0.1 的单个 Fourier 三波扩展到 dyadic 分解。 计算中，远离对角线的相互作用有可求和的小因子；异号高频螺旋和近对角三波仍没有这样的增益。": "I extend a single Fourier triad to dyadic decomposition. In calculations, off-diagonal interactions have summable small factors; opposite-sign high-frequency spirals and near-diagonal triads do not have such gains.",
  "我整理了 low–high、high–low、high–high→low 的估计，并比较同号与异号螺旋三波。": "I organized estimates for low–high, high–low, and high–high→low and compared same-sign with opposite-sign helical triads.",
