  "研究笔记 R0.2：三维 Navier–Stokes 临界 H 半范数中的 dyadic 非局部尾、螺旋三波传递与近对角障碍。": "research note R0.2: three-dimensional Navier–Stokes critical H seminorm dyadic nonlocal tail, helical triad transfer and near-diagonal obstruction.",
  "一个零和三波 \\(\\boldsymbol k+\\boldsymbol p+\\boldsymbol q=0\\) 有八种符号组合。 记 \\(K=|\\boldsymbol k|\\le P=|\\boldsymbol p|\\le Q=|\\boldsymbol q|\\)， 对固定 \\((s_K,s_P,s_Q)\\)，Waleffe 的单三波方程把三个模能量率写成同一个实标量 \\(\\Phi\\) 乘以": "a zero and three-wave \\(\\boldsymbol k+\\boldsymbol p+\\boldsymbol q=0\\) has eight sign combinations. Note \\(K=|\\boldsymbol k|\\le P=|\\boldsymbol p|\\le Q=|\\boldsymbol q|\\), for fixed \\((s_K,s_P,s_Q)\\), Waleffe's single three-wave equation writes the three modal energy rates as one real scalar \\(\\Phi\\) multiplied by",
