  "因为 \\(\\langle u_{\\le j-M}\\cdot\\nabla u_j,u_j\\rangle=0\\)。": "because \\(\\langle u_{\\le j-M}\\cdot\\nabla u_j,u_j\\rangle=0\\).",
  "用整数三波族检查公式": "check formula with integer triad family",
  "有限壳宽内仍只有 \\(C\\|u\\|_{\\dot H^{1/2}}\\|u\\|_{\\dot H^{3/2}}^2\\)。": "still only \\(C\\|u\\|_{\\dot H^{1/2}}\\|u\\|_{\\dot H^{3/2}}^2\\) within finite shell width.",
  "有限邻壳求和后， \\(|R_M^{HH\\to L}|\\le C2^{-3M}AB^2\\)。 这个三阶衰减并非相位平均，而是无散性与临界权重共同产生的确定性估计。": "after summing over finite neighboring shells, \\(|R_M^{HH\\to L}|\\le C2^{-3M}AB^2\\). This third-order decay is not phase-averaged but a deterministic estimate produced by the divergence-free condition and critical weighting together.",
  "与两个高频能量率同阶。仅靠能量与 helicity 守恒不能产生 \\(K/P\\) 抑制。 因而，不能假定所有非局部螺旋三波都会成对近抵消。": "at the same order as two high-frequency energy rates. Energy and helicity conservation alone cannot produce suppression of \\(K/P\\). Thus, it cannot be assumed that all nonlocal helical triad transfers will pairwise nearly cancel out.",
