  "在 \\(\\mathbb T^3_{2\\pi}\\) 上取标准光滑 Littlewood–Paley 分解 \\(u=\\sum_j u_j\\)、\\(u_j=\\Delta_j u\\)，记 \\(\\lambda_j=2^j\\)。 零均值消除了齐次范数的零频问题；有限个最低壳只改变常数。": "On the \\(\\mathbb T^3_{2\\pi}\\), take the standard smooth Littlewood–Paley decomposition of \\(u=\\sum_j u_j\\) and \\(u_j=\\Delta_j u\\), denoting it as \\(\\lambda_j=2^j\\). The zero mean eliminates the zero frequency issue for homogeneous norms; a finite number of lowest shells only change constants.",
  "在 \\(K:P:Q\\in[1/2,2]^3\\) 且满足三角闭合的紧参数域上，定位耦合零点、退化角和最大值。": "Locate coupled zeros, degenerate angles, and maxima on the \\(K:P:Q\\in[1/2,2]^3\\) with triangular closure in a compact parameter domain.",
  "这里 \\(|h-j|\\le c\\)，故 \\(\\lambda_h\\simeq\\lambda_j\\)。": "Here \\(|h-j|\\le c\\), hence \\(\\lambda_h\\simeq\\lambda_j\\).",
  "这里的尾部估计是经典交换子、Bernstein 不等式与 Bony 分解的直接组合。 我写出逐项推导和计算脚本，方便复查。它不是新的定理，也没有闭合近对角临界项。 这些计算只说明：仅靠远距离三波抵消，还不足以得到大数据先验界。": "The tail estimate here is a direct combination of classical commutators, Bernstein inequalities, and Bony decomposition. I write out the step-by-step derivation and computational scripts for verification. It is not a new theorem and does not close near-diagonal critical terms. These calculations only show that mere far-field three-wave cancellations are insufficient to obtain a priori bounds in the large-data regime.",
  "这一步留下什么": "What remains at this step",
  "这一步说明": "What this step illustrates",
  "这一特定几何中 \\(Q-P=1/(Q+P)\\sim(2N)^{-1}\\)，所以同号类甚至显示 \\(N^{-2}\\) 的相对抑制； 普遍三角界只保证 \\(O(K/P)\\)。异号类趋近常数量级，没有衰减。": "In this specific geometry, \\(Q-P=1/(Q+P)\\sim(2N)^{-1}\\), so same-sign classes even show relative suppression of \\(N^{-2}\\); general triangular bounds only guarantee \\(O(K/P)\\). Opposite-sign classes approach constant magnitude without decay.",
