  "High–low：导数落在慢变量": "High–low: derivative falls on slow variable",
  "Littlewood–Paley 与粗粒化文献早已证明能量通量主要由相近尺度控制。": "Littlewood–Paley and coarse-graining literature have long established that energy flux is primarily controlled by nearby scales.",
