  "Waleffe 进一步用“instability assumption”讨论平均传递方向；那是湍流闭合中的动力学假设。 这里只使用单三波方程及其精确守恒比。我不由此推断完整 Navier–Stokes 解的级联方向。": "Waleffe further discusses the average transport direction using \"instability assumption\" in turbulence closure; that is a dynamical hypothesis in turbulent closure. Here only single three-wave equations and their exact conservation ratios are used. I do not infer the cascade direction of complete Navier–Stokes solutions from this.",
