  "特别是，孤立三元组是稀疏的。它没有产生 Bernstein 不等式中一个频率壳所含格点数带来的重数。 因此，这个极值不能直接当作完整偏微分方程估计的尖锐性反例。": "particularly, isolated triples are sparse. It does not generate the multiplicity of lattice points in a frequency shell as in Bernstein's inequality. Therefore, this extremum cannot be directly used as a sharp counterexample to full partial differential equation estimates.",
