  "同号类有精确抵消，但三个异号类在近对角紧域上保留非零常数量级的最大值。 因此，不存在一个仅由单三元组几何产生、同时适用于全部螺旋符号类的统一小因子。": "There is exact cancellation in the same-sign class, but three opposite-sign classes retain nonzero constant magnitudes on near-diagonal compact domains. Therefore, there does not exist a unifying small factor generated solely by single triad geometries that applies to all helical sign classes.",
  "同号螺旋类的临界核恒为零；三个异号类保留非零的近对角极值。": "The critical kernel of the same-sign helical class vanishes identically; the three opposite-sign classes retain nonzero near-diagonal extrema.",
