  "为覆盖 R0.2 的近对角区域，令 \\(x=K/P\\)、\\(y=Q/P\\)，并按边长排序后考察紧域": "To cover the near-diagonal region within R0.2, let \\(x=K/P\\) and \\(y=Q/P\\), then sort by edge length and examine the compact domain",
  "我继续检查 R0.2 留下的近对角区域。单个三元组中，同号螺旋的临界加权传递恒为零； 三个异号类仍有非零极值。计算给出了完整零点集和解析最大值。": "I continue to check the near-diagonal region left in R0.2. In single triads, the critical weighted transfer of the same-sign helical class is always zero; three opposite-sign classes still retain nonzero extremal values. Calculations provided complete zero sets and analytic maximum values.",
  "系数规范以 Waleffe 的原始工作为准，并与 Linkmann 等人写出的单三元组方程和侧长公式交叉核对。 不同文献若把螺旋基归一化为单位长度，常数会改变，但本笔记的零点和相对几何结论不变。": "The coefficient normalization is based on Waleffe's original work and cross-verified with formulas for single triad equations and side length formulas written by Linkmann et al. If different literature normalizes the helical basis to unit length, constants will change, but the zero points and relative geometric conclusions in this note remain unchanged.",
  "下一步应把单三元组扩展为一个有限但稠密的 Fourier 频率包。 目标不是立即证明先验界，而是先回答常规临界三线性估计是否能被具有散度零约束的显式数据近似饱和。": "The next step should be to extend a single triad into a finite but dense Fourier frequency packet. The goal is not immediate proof of a priori bounds but rather to first address whether the standard critical trilinear estimate can be saturated by explicit data approximations with divergence zero constraints.",
