  "这份笔记得到什么": "what does this note yield",
  "这个恒等式适用于同号螺旋子系统。完整 Navier–Stokes 同时包含异号类，不能由此推出完整系统的 \\(\\dot H^{1/2}\\) 守恒或先验界。": "this identity applies to same-sign helical subsystems. The full Navier–Stokes simultaneously includes opposite-sign classes, and thus one cannot infer from it that the \\(\\dot H^{1/2}\\) of the complete system is conserved or has a priori bounds.",
  "这是对一个有限维核的精确计算，不是新定理，也不是 Navier–Stokes 正则性结果。 它只检验一种可能的机制：近对角三元组的几何是否对所有螺旋符号都自动给出小因子。答案是否定的。": "this is an exact calculation for a finite-dimensional kernel, not a new theorem nor Navier–Stokes regularity results. It only tests one possible mechanism: whether the geometry of near-diagonal triads automatically yields small factors for all helical signs. The answer is no.",
