  "存在真实无散场 \\(u_N\\)，其活跃模态数为 \\(O(N^3)\\)，并全部位于固定相对宽度的高频环带。": "There exists a real divergence-free field \\(u_N\\) whose active mode number is \\(O(N^3)\\), all located in a fixed relative width high frequency annulus.",
  "当 \\(\\delta\\) 足够小时，六个 bump 两两分离；能闭合的支撑组合只来自上述三元组及其共轭。 对每个组合作 \\(\\xi=\\kappa_j+\\delta X\\)、\\(\\eta=\\kappa_\\ell+\\delta Y\\) 的变量代换。 被积函数中的投影、长度和振幅连续收敛到中心值，而 \\(\\int\\!\\!\\int\\psi(X)\\psi(Y)\\psi(X+Y)\\,dX\\,dY>0\\)。 因此 \\[ \\delta^{-6}\\mathfrak T_{\\mathbb R^3}(a_\\delta) \\longrightarrow C_0,\\qquad C_0\\ne0. \\] 这里 \\(C_0\\) 是正重叠积分与中心三元组临界传递 \\(\\sqrt2-1\\) 的一个非零实数倍。 于是某个充分小的固定 \\(\\delta\\) 满足 \\(\\mathfrak T_{\\mathbb R^3}(a_\\delta)\\ne0\\)。": "When \\(\\delta\\) is sufficiently small, six bumps separate pairwise; only support combinations that can close come from the above triads and their conjugates. For each combination use the variable substitution of \\(\\xi=\\kappa_j+\\delta X\\) and \\(\\eta=\\kappa_\\ell+\\delta Y\\). The projections in the integrand, lengths, and amplitudes converge continuously to central values, while \\(\\int\\!\\!\\int\\psi(X)\\psi(Y)\\psi(X+Y)\\,dX\\,dY>0\\). Therefore, \\[ \\delta^{-6}\\mathfrak T_{\\mathbb R^3}(a_\\delta) \\longrightarrow C_0,\\qquad C_0\\ne0. \\] here, \\(C_0\\) is a positive overlapping integral with the critical transfer of \\(\\sqrt2-1\\) as a non-zero real multiple. Thus, some sufficiently small fixed \\(\\delta\\) satisfies \\(\\mathfrak T_{\\mathbb R^3}(a_\\delta)\\ne0\\).",
  "动力学可持续性": "Dynamical sustainability",
  "对截断 Navier–Stokes ODE 使用保持现实、无散和能量恒等式的时间步进。": "For the truncated Navier–Stokes ODE use time-stepping that preserves reality, divergence-free, and energy conservation.",
  "对象：临界三线性型": "Object: critical trilinear form",
