  "把 \\(\\mathfrak T_{\\mathbb R^3}(a)\\) 的被积核记为 \\(K(\\xi,\\eta)\\)，并设 \\(S(\\xi,\\eta)=|\\xi|^2+|\\eta|^2+|\\xi+\\eta|^2\\)。则": "Let the integrand of \\(\\mathfrak T_{\\mathbb R^3}(a)\\) be denoted as \\(K(\\xi,\\eta)\\), and set \\(S(\\xi,\\eta)=|\\xi|^2+|\\eta|^2+|\\xi+\\eta|^2\\). Then",
  "把截断从 15 降到 13，终点能量、支撑外比例和对齐差异均低于 0.5%，但三线性量的符号改变。": "The truncation is reduced from 15 to 13, with endpoint energy, support outside ratio, and alignment difference all below 0.5%, but the sign of the trilinear quantity changes.",
  "版本 v0.5 · 2026-08-16": "Version v0.5 · 2026-08-16",
