  "对当前近对角几何，保持临界注入时可以通过 2D3C 振幅排列显著降低一阶频谱泄漏， 并把有限维增长延长一个可分辨的抛物时间。原剖面的快速失相不是普适障碍。": "for the current near-diagonal geometry, by maintaining critical injection, one can significantly reduce first-order spectral leakage over a finite-dimensional growth and extend it to a resolvable parabolic time. The rapid desynchronization of the original profile is not a universal obstruction.",
  "对光滑解使用 \\(\\dot H^{1/2}\\) 中的一阶展开： \\[ u(t)=u_0+t[-\\nu\\Lambda^2u_0-B(u_0,u_0)]+o(t). \\] Fourier 乘子 \\(\\Lambda^2\\) 保持 \\(X_S\\)，所以法向投影消去初值和黏性项，只留下 \\(-tB_{\\rm out}+o(t)\\)。 线性子空间的距离等于法向投影范数，结论随即得到。": "use smooth solutions \\(\\dot H^{1/2}\\) the first-order expansion in: \\[ u(t)=u_0+t[-\\nu\\Lambda^2u_0-B(u_0,u_0)]+o(t). \\] Fourier multiplier \\(\\Lambda^2\\) maintain \\(X_S\\), hence the normal projection eliminates the initial data and viscosity term, leaving \\(-tB_{\\rm out}+o(t)\\). The distance in the linear subspace equals the norm of the normal projection, and the conclusion follows immediately.",
