  "原剖面的法向分量占主导": "normal component of the original profile dominates",
  "原泄漏占比": "original leakage proportion",
  "原振幅": "Original amplitude",
  "原中心振幅的 \\(\\Xi=53.1584\\)。十二参数 SLSQP 使用解析梯度和 12 个独立起点， 找到同一目标值 \\(\\Xi=3.72044852\\)，但这项数值一致性不是全十二参数的全局最优证明。": "The original central amplitude's \\(\\Xi=53.1584\\). A twelve-parameter SLSQP with analytical gradients and 12 independent starting points found the same target value \\(\\Xi=3.72044852\\), but this numerical consistency is not a proof of global optimality for all twelve parameters.",
  "在 \\(N=120\\) 时，逃逸/注入比从 58.24 降到 6.25，注入与初始临界范数保持不变。": "in the \\(N=120\\), escape/injection ratio drops from 58.24 to 6.25, injection remains with initial critical norm.",
  "增长延长但没有持续": "growth prolongs but not sustained",
  "这条定理说明：具有非零临界传递的有限包不可能成为一种新的精确有限模态 Euler 轨道。 R0.6 研究的是较弱而定量的问题：向量场在初始时刻离有限频谱子空间有多远， 以及能否在保持注入时让这个距离变小。": "this theorem states: finite packets with non-zero critical transfer cannot become a new exact finite mode Euler orbit. R0.6 investigates the weaker and quantitative problem: how far vector fields are from finite spectral subspaces at initial time, and whether this distance can be reduced while maintaining injection.",
  "支撑外输出": "out-of-support output",
  "直接枚举六模态卷积得到": "directly enumerate hexaconvolution to obtain",
  "只有在获得随 \\(N\\) 与 Galerkin 截断统一的估计后，才讨论完整 PDE 的含义。": "only after obtaining a unified estimate with Galerkin truncation for \\(N\\), the meaning of full PDE is discussed.",
  "中心频率仍取 \\(\\kappa_1=(1,0,0)\\)、\\(\\kappa_2=(0,1,0)\\)、\\(\\kappa_3=(-1,-1,0)\\)。 一般真实无散六模态场有十二个实振幅参数。多起点约束搜索提示，固定注入的低泄漏点落在以下 2D3C 子族：": "The central frequency still takes \\(\\kappa_1=(1,0,0)\\), \\(\\kappa_2=(0,1,0)\\), \\(\\kappa_3=(-1,-1,0)\\). Generally, a real incompressible six-mode Fourier modal field has twelve real amplitude parameters. A multi-start constrained search hint suggests that fixed injection of low leakage points fall into the following 2D3C subfamily:",
  "作者预印本": "author preprint",
  "Kishimoto 与 Yoneda 已刻画三维实值、有限 Fourier 支撑的 Euler 解：除平面型稳态流和 Beltrami 流外， 不存在其他有限模态 Euler 流。论文还讨论了黏性和 Coriolis 项存在时的相应分类。": "Kishimoto and Yoneda have characterized three-dimensional real-valued, finite Fourier-supported Euler solutions: apart from planar-type steady flows and Beltrami flows, no other finite-mode Euler flows exist. The paper also discusses corresponding classifications when viscosity and Coriolis terms are present.",
