  "版本 v0.7 · 2026-08-16": "version v0.7 · 2026-08-16",
  "笔记状态 · 两个命题已证明，动力学为有限维计算": "note status · Two propositions have been proven, dynamics are finite-dimensional computations",
  "闭式公式与直接 Leray-Fourier 卷积在 2,000 个固定随机样本上比较。 \\(E\\)、\\(\\mathfrak T\\) 和 \\(F\\) 的最大相对差为 \\(8.12\\times10^{-15}\\)。": "closed-form formulas compared with direct Leray-Fourier convolution on 2,000 fixed random samples. The maximum relative differences of \\(E\\), \\(\\mathfrak T\\), and \\(F\\) are \\(8.12\\times10^{-15}\\).",
