  "稠密 bump 提升不同：球形频谱厚度包含 \\(k_3\\ne0\\) 模态， 所以有限 \\(N,\\delta\\) 的 Galerkin 初值是真正三维的。 这正是下一步必须单独量化的部分。": "dense bump differences: spherical spectral thickness includes \\(k_3\\ne0\\) modes, so the finite Galerkin initial data of \\(N,\\delta\\) is truly three-dimensional. This is exactly what must be quantified separately in the next step.",
  "稠密包属于已知慢变量大数据的全局正则定理；": "dense packets belong to global regularity theorems for known slow variables in large-data regime;",
  "初始法向强迫只有 \\(\\pm(1,2,0)\\) 与 \\(\\pm(2,1,0)\\) 四个纯垂直模态， 每个系数为 \\(-AC=-0.00868788\\)。 这再次显示中心动力学主要是第三分量的标量混合。": "initial normal forcing only has \\(\\pm(1,2,0)\\) and \\(\\pm(2,1,0)\\) four pure vertical modes, each coefficient being \\(-AC=-0.00868788\\). This again shows that the central dynamics are mainly scalar mixing of the third component.",
  "传递是一个三次量，泄漏是四项平方和": "transfer is a cubic quantity, leakage is a sum of four squares",
  "到 \\(\\tau=0.1\\)，生成模态仍给出负传递；净换号由原支撑的正传递主导。": "to \\(\\tau=0.1\\), generated modes still give negative transfer; net sign change is dominated by positive transfer from the original support.",
  "得到下界，也划清边界": "obtain a lower bound, also delineate the boundary",
  "第一项来自 \\(k_1-k_2\\)；后两组来自 \\(k_2-k_3\\) 与 \\(k_3-k_1\\) 及其共轭频率。 这也是一个直接的平方和表示。": "The first term comes from \\(k_1-k_2\\); the last two groups come from \\(k_2-k_3\\) and \\(k_3-k_1\\) along with their conjugate frequencies. This is also a direct square sum representation.",
  "定义三个复差量": "Define three complex quantities",
  "对 R0.6 的修正解释": "A corrected explanation for R0.6",
  "对任意上述实值无散六模态场， \\[ |\\mathfrak T(u)| \\le 2(\\sqrt2-1) \\left[ c_1 E^{1/2}F^{1/2} c_2 E F^{1/4} \\right]. \\]": "For any of the above real-valued divergence-free six-mode fields, \\[ |\\mathfrak T(u)| \\le 2(\\sqrt2-1) \\left[ c_1 E^{1/2}F^{1/2} c_2 E F^{1/4} \\right]. \\]",
  "对象：六模态泄漏与近二维动力学": "Object: Six-mode leakage and near two-dimensional dynamics",
  "对原问题最有价值的不是把 \\(F\\) 再降低几个百分点，而是识别必须新增的机制： 非共面波数、水平涡量拉伸反馈，以及能在时间区间上抵抗切向标量换号的相位网络。": "What is most valuable for the original problem is not to further reduce a few percentage points of \\(F\\) but to identify mechanisms that must be added: noncoplanar wavenumbers, horizontal vorticity stretch feedback, and phase networks that can resist tangential scalar sign changes over time intervals.",
  "非零临界传递显式强迫正泄漏": "Explicit positive leakage for nonzero critical transfer",
