  "\\(E_{\\max}=1.0969903\\)，随后粘性半速率重新占优。": "\\(E_{\\max}=1.0969903\\), then viscosity at half rate reasserts dominance.",
  "\\[ E=6(A^2+B^2)+2\\sqrt2(C^2+D^2), \\] \\[ \\mathfrak T=4(\\sqrt2-1)AB(C+D), \\] \\[ (\\mathfrak S_1,\\mathfrak S_2,\\mathfrak S_3) =-2AB(C+D,\\ C,\\ D). \\] 因而 \\[ \\boxed{\\mathfrak S=-(\\sqrt2+1)\\mathfrak T}. \\]": "\\[ E=6(A^2+B^2)+2\\sqrt2(C^2+D^2), \\] \\[ \\mathfrak T=4(\\sqrt2-1)AB(C+D), \\]\\[ (\\mathfrak S_1,\\mathfrak S_2,\\mathfrak S_3) =-2AB(C+D,\\ C,\\ D). \\] Therefore, \\[ \\boxed{\\mathfrak S=-(\\sqrt2+1)\\mathfrak T}. \\]",
