  "版本 v0.10 · 2026-08-16": "version v0.10 · 2026-08-16",
  "本笔记第一次在这组研究笔记中同时满足三点：目标初始为空、热积分被完整保留、输出临界能量在 \\(N\\to\\infty\\) 时保持正值。 因此它比 R0.4 的瞬时三线性下界更接近真实的因果传递，也明确解释了 \\(N^3\\) 配对重数怎样抵消抛物尺度损失。": "This note is the first to simultaneously satisfy three points in this group of research notes: target initial empty, heat integral fully retained, and output critical energy remains positive when \\(N\\to\\infty\\). Therefore, it is closer to true causal propagation than R0.4's instantaneous trilinear lower bound, and explicitly explains how the pairing multiplicity of \\(N^3\\) cancels out the parabolic scale loss.",
  "本笔记检查最小的补充问题：让目标初始为零，把一个真实跨壳三元组增厚到 \\(m_N\\asymp N^3\\)， 再问热积分后的目标 \\(\\dot H^{1/2}\\) 能量能否保持正的尺度极限。": "This note examines the smallest supplementary problem: setting the target initial to zero, thickening a real shell triad to \\(m_N\\asymp N^3\\), and then asking whether the target energy \\(\\dot H^{1/2}\\) after the heat integral can maintain a positive scale limit.",
  "笔记状态 · 连续极限与小包渐近已证明，有限 N 为直接计算": "note status · Continuous limits and small packet asymptotics have been proven, finite N for direct computation",
  "尺度损失解除，迭代兼容仍失败": "scale loss removed, iteration compatibility still fails",
  "尺度一致目标下界": "lower bound under scale-consistent target",
  "从 R0.9 的第一条跨壳边出发": "starting from the first cross-shell edge of R0.9",
  "存在与矩阵 \\(M\\) 相容的多门极化循环；": "there exists a multipolar circulation compatible with the matrix \\(M\\);",
  "第二张表让 \\(\\delta N\\approx4.3\\)，检查小包阶数。": "the second table checks the order of small packets for \\(\\delta N\\approx4.3\\).",
  "第一 Picard 下界能压过完整非线性余项；": "a lower bound on the first Picard term can dominate the full nonlinear remainder;",
  "第一 Picard 项有连续剖面极限": "the first Picard term has a continuous profile limit",
  "第一代可以保持临界尺度，但还不是级联": "First generation can maintain the critical scale but is not yet a cascade",
  "对非零泄漏中心，Leray 核、热因子和极化都光滑；中心值为零使卷积系数从 \\(O(\\delta^3)\\) 降到 \\(O(\\delta^4)\\)。 输出区域体积为 \\(O(\\delta^3)\\)，归一化前能量为 \\(O(\\delta^{11})\\)， 再除以 \\(E_\\delta^2=O(\\delta^6)\\) 得 \\(O(\\delta^5)\\)。 零频附近还多一个 \\(|\\kappa|=O(\\delta)\\) 权重，不会变坏。": "For non-zero leakage centers, Leray kernel, heat factor, and polarization are smooth; center values of zero reduce convolution coefficients from \\(O(\\delta^3)\\) to \\(O(\\delta^4)\\). The output region volume is \\(O(\\delta^3)\\), normalized energy before as \\(O(\\delta^{11})\\), and further divided by \\(E_\\delta^2=O(\\delta^6)\\) yielding \\(O(\\delta^5)\\). An additional \\(|\\kappa|=O(\\delta)\\) weight near zero frequency does not deteriorate.",
  "对象：四叶临界包与第一 Picard 输出": "Object: critical four-leaf packet with first Picard output",
  "非目标输出比主项多损失两个包宽": "Non-target outputs lose two packet widths more than the main term",
  "固定临界输入能量后，目标第一 Picard 能量趋于正数；其小 \\(\\delta\\) 主项已显式计算。": "After fixing the critical input energy, the target first Picard energy tends to a positive number; its small \\(\\delta\\) leading term is explicitly computed.",
  "归一化目标能量": "Normalize target energy",
  "计算三个 Leray 双线性映射的像、核与复相位自由度，判断其复合是否存在非零极化循环。": "Compute images, kernels, and complex phase degrees of freedom for three Leray bilinear mappings, determine if their composite has non-zero polarization cycles.",
  "记 \\(\\chi=\\mathbf1_{B(0,1)}\\)。两个单位球交叠体积为 \\((\\chi*\\chi)(z)=\\pi(4+r)(2-r)^2/12\\)，其中 \\(r=|z|\\le2\\)。 因而": "Let \\(\\chi=\\mathbf1_{B(0,1)}\\). Overlapping volume of two unit balls is \\((\\chi*\\chi)(z)=\\pi(4+r)(2-r)^2/12\\), where \\(r=|z|\\le2\\). Thus",
  "记 \\(\\mathbb P_\\xi=I-\\xi\\otimes\\xi/|\\xi|^2\\)。两个有序输入在目标中心给出": "Let \\(\\mathbb P_\\xi=I-\\xi\\otimes\\xi/|\\xi|^2\\). Two ordered inputs at the target center give",
  "跨越任意多个尺度时目标/泄漏比保持一致；": "When crossing any number of scales, the target/leakage ratio remains consistent;",
  "理论常数 \\(c_*=0.00151916543\\) 落在观测范围内；相对泄漏除以 \\(\\delta^2\\) 保持在 0.83 到 0.85。 输入现实残差为零，输入与输出散度残差均低于 \\(4\\times10^{-15}\\) 的代码阈值。 这些数字复核证明中的阶数，不替代 \\(N\\to\\infty\\) 或 \\(\\delta\\to0\\) 的解析论证。": "Theoretical constant \\(c_*=0.00151916543\\) falls within observed range; relative leakage divided by \\(\\delta^2\\) stays between 0.83 and 0.85. Input real residual is zero, input and output divergence residuals are below the code threshold of \\(4\\times10^{-15}\\). These numbers verify order in proof but do not replace analytical arguments for \\(N\\to\\infty\\) or \\(\\delta\\to0\\).",
  "理论重数极限为 \\(0.01447645895\\)，小包目标主项为 \\(2.62512\\times10^{-6}\\)。 \\(N=48\\) 的两项分别达到 \\(0.0144495\\) 和 \\(2.59600\\times10^{-6}\\)。": "Theoretical multiplicity limit is \\(0.01447645895\\), small packet target leading term as \\(2.62512\\times10^{-6}\\). The two terms of \\(N=48\\) reach \\(0.0144495\\) and \\(2.59600\\times10^{-6}\\) respectively.",
  "令 \\(\\mathbf1_E\\) 为集合 \\(E\\) 的示性函数。对 \\(0<\\delta<1/4\\) 定义连续剖面": "Let \\(\\mathbf1_E\\) for the set \\(E\\) its characteristic function. For \\(0<\\delta<1/4\\) Define continuous profile",
  "令 \\(v_{N,\\delta}=E_{N,\\delta}^{-1/2}u_{N,\\delta}\\)，并令 \\(w(v_{N,\\delta})\\) 表示其第一 Picard 项。则 \\[ \\boxed{ \\lim_{\\delta\\downarrow0}\\delta^{-3} \\lim_{N\\to\\infty} \\|P_{NT_\\delta}w(v_{N,\\delta})(\\tau_*/N^2)\\|_{\\dot H^{1/2}}^2 =c_*, } \\] 其中 \\[ c_*=\\frac{136\\pi\\sqrt6}{688905} =0.0015191654312453548\\ldots>0. \\]": "Let \\(v_{N,\\delta}=E_{N,\\delta}^{-1/2}u_{N,\\delta}\\), denote its first Picard term as \\(w(v_{N,\\delta})\\). Then \\[ \\boxed{ \\lim_{\\delta\\downarrow0}\\delta^{-3} \\lim_{N\\to\\infty} \\|P_{NT_\\delta}w(v_{N,\\delta})(\\tau_*/N^2)\\|_{\\dot H^{1/2}}^2 =c_*, } \\] where \\[ c_*=\\frac{136\\pi\\sqrt6}{688905} =0.0015191654312453548\\ldots>0. \\]",
  "每个卷积项含 \\(N^{-3}\\)：一个导数给 \\(N\\)，两个输入系数给 \\(N^{-4}\\)。 三维输入求和把它恢复到 \\(O(1)\\)，时间积分再给 \\(N^{-2}\\)。 输出 \\(\\dot H^{1/2}\\) 和的 \\(N^3\\) 格点数、\\(N\\) 权重与 \\(N^{-4}\\) 系数平方恰好抵消。": "Each convolution term contains \\(N^{-3}\\): one derivative for \\(N\\), two input coefficients for \\(N^{-4}\\). Three-dimensional input summation restores it to \\(O(1)\\), time integration gives \\(N^{-2}\\). Output \\(\\dot H^{1/2}\\) and the \\(N^3\\) grid points, \\(N\\) weights, and \\(N^{-4}\\) coefficient squares exactly cancel.",
  "命题 1：第一 Picard Riemann 极限。": "Proposition 1: First Picard Riemann limit.",
  "命题 2：归一化目标能量的显式下界。": "Proposition 2: Explicit lower bound for normalized target energy.",
