  "目标包能在第二 Picard 时间窗内保持形状和相位；": "The target packet can maintain its shape and phase within the second Picard time window;",
  "目标能量为 \\(c_*\\delta^3+O(\\delta^4)\\)，非目标能量为 \\(O(\\delta^5)\\)。": "the target energy is \\(c_*\\delta^3+O(\\delta^4)\\), and the non-target energy is \\(O(\\delta^5)\\).",
