  "二次项采用 \\[ \\mathcal B(U,V)_k =i\\mathbb P_k\\!\\sum_{p+q=k}(q\\cdot U_p)V_q. \\] 程序对每一阶检查共轭对称和 \\(k\\cdot U_m(k)=0\\)。第八层的最大残差分别为 \\(2.7\\times10^{-12}\\) 与 \\(1.2\\times10^{-10}\\)。": "quadratic terms are checked for conjugate symmetry and the \\(k\\cdot U_m(k)=0\\) program using the \\[ \\mathcal B(U,V)_k =i\\mathbb P_k\\!\\sum_{p+q=k}(q\\cdot U_p)V_q. \\] procedure. The maximum residuals of the eighth layer are \\(2.7\\times10^{-12}\\) and \\(1.2\\times10^{-10}\\).",
  "负频率系数取复共轭，因此场为实值；每个极化都在对应波数的正交平面内。 \\(B_n,D_n\\) 是 R0.11 中同时消去 \\(a_n-b_n\\) 与 \\(a_n-d_n\\) 中心差频的单位镜像极化。 本文主表取 \\(\\varepsilon=0.2\\)。": "The negative-frequency coefficients are complex conjugates, so the field is real-valued; each polarization lies in the plane orthogonal to its wavenumber. \\(B_n,D_n\\) are the unit mirror polarizations from R0.11 that simultaneously cancel the central difference frequencies \\(a_n-b_n\\) and \\(a_n-d_n\\). The main table uses \\(\\varepsilon=0.2\\).",
  "复现脚本：": "Reproduce script:",
  "个人计算记录，不代表同行评议结论。": "Personal computational record, not representing peer review conclusions.",
  "固定两个翼门和单位长度后，同时消去两个差频的候选只有 R0.11 的镜像选择。": "After fixing both wing gates and unit length, the only candidate for simultaneously canceling two difference frequencies is the mirror choice of R0.11.",
  "候选数": "candidate numbers",
  "极化变分把“首阶泄漏较小”与“差频消失”之间的代价量化为 \\(10.25\\) 对 \\(14\\)。": "Polar variation quantifies the cost between \"first-order leakage small\" and \"difference frequency vanishes\" as \\(10.25\\) for \\(14\\).",
  "极限泄漏系数": "limit leakage coefficient",
  "记 \\(x=4^n\\)。频率仍取自 \\(M=I+\\mathbf1\\mathbf1^\\top\\) 生成的锥链。 旧壳放入 \\(P_{n-1},Q_{n-1}\\)，新壳预置 \\(b_n,d_n\\)。正频率初值为": "Let \\(x=4^n\\). Frequencies are still taken from the cone chain generated by \\(M=I+\\mathbf1\\mathbf1^\\top\\). The old shell is placed in \\(P_{n-1},Q_{n-1}\\), and the new shell is pre-set as \\(b_n,d_n\\). Positive frequency initial data are",
