  "按降幂排列，系数只有一次符号变化，故 Descartes 符号法则给出唯一正根。 又因能量比在 \\(z\\to0^+\\) 和 \\(z\\to\\infty\\) 时都趋于无穷，该根给出唯一全局极小：": "By descending powers, the coefficients have only one sign change, so Descartes' rule of signs gives a unique positive root. Since the energy ratio tends to infinity in both \\(z\\to0^+\\) and \\(z\\to\\infty\\) cases, this root provides the unique global minimum:",
  "把根节点的左右子树 Taylor 阶数记为 \\((a,b)\\)，其中 \\(a+b=4\\)。 下表已把两种对称侧类相加；所有条目都省略共同因子 \\(\\sqrt6\\)。": "The Taylor order of the left and right subtrees of the root node is denoted by \\((a,b)\\), where \\(a+b=4\\). The table has already summed both symmetric side classes; all entries omit the common factor \\(\\sqrt6\\).",
  "版本 v0.13 · 2026-08-16": "Version v0.13 · 2026-08-16",
  "本文没有接近上述结果的结论强度。它的价值更窄：预定三门接力的系数不只是“不准确”， 而是被一种可精确分解的四阶子树回馈所支配；在当前固定极化族内，共同幅度调节无法修复同阶外部能量。 这排除了继续只调一个标量参数的路线，并把下一次搜索集中到振幅比、复相位和极化方向。": "There is no conclusion of similar strength to the above results. Its value is narrower: the coefficient for the planned three-wave relay is not just \"inaccurate,\" but dominated by a precisely decomposable fourth-order sub-tree feedback; within the current fixed polarization family, joint amplitude modulation cannot repair external energy at the same order. This excludes the path of adjusting only one scalar parameter and focuses the next search on amplitude ratios, complex phases, and polarization directions.",
  "笔记状态 · 精确有限阶结论，PDE 时间余项未估计": "Note status · precise finite-order conclusions, PDE time remainder unestimated",
  "不等幅、一般复相位与频率包": "inhomogeneous amplitudes, general complex phase, and frequency envelope",
  "层 \\(n\\)": "layer \\(n\\)",
  "纯非线性、六次齐次第五阶系数": "pure nonlinearity, hexic homogeneous fifth-order coefficient",
  "单个侧类的向量不在目标一维线上；两侧互为坐标镜像，相加后横向分量消去。 中心类本身就在目标线上。三者相加得到": "The vector for a single side class is not on the target one-dimensional line; the sides are coordinate mirrors of each other, and their addition cancels out the horizontal components. The central class itself lies on the target line. Their sum gives",
  "第 \\(m\\) 阶只需保留 Laurent 指数窗 \\(-m\\le \\ell\\le5-m\\)，因为每次剩余相互作用最多再降低一次指数。 这给出有限的精确算法。递推各中间项可以出现负幂，但把正负频率全部聚合后， 第五阶 306 个非零极限频率中未留下任何负次幂。": "The \\(m\\)th order requires retaining only the Laurent index window \\(-m\\le \\ell\\le5-m\\) because each remaining interaction can reduce the exponent at most once. This provides a finite accurate algorithm. The recursive intermediate terms may appear with negative powers, but after aggregating positive and negative frequencies, there are no negative powers left in the 306 non-zero limit frequencies of the fifth order.",
  "第五阶目标存在，但固定极化下不可能占据主能量": "The fifth-order target exists but cannot be occupied by the main energy under fixed polarization",
  "第五阶以后以及完整 Taylor 余项": "After the fifth order and complete Taylor remainder",
  "调节共同催化幅度能否让目标频率在同阶能量中占主导。": "Can common catalytic amplitude adjustment make the target frequency dominant at the same order of external energy.",
  "对 R0.11 的固定四个极化，取两种催化模态为相同实幅 \\(\\varepsilon\\) 和相同相位。 在 \\(n\\to\\infty\\) 的退化锥极限中，第五阶纯非线性、六次齐次系数满足 \\[ \\frac{E_{\\mathrm{ext}}^{(5)}}{E_{\\mathrm{tar}}^{(5)}} \\ge 45.739348964727\\ldots, \\qquad \\frac{E_{\\mathrm{tar}}^{(5)}}{E_{\\mathrm{all}}^{(5)}} \\le 0.0213952488032\\ldots . \\] 小数由一个明示六次多项式的唯一正根计算；唯一性和全局极小性由符号变化及端点行为给出。": "Four polarizations are fixed for R0.11, with two catalytic modes having the same real part \\(\\varepsilon\\) and the same phase. In the degenerate cone limit \\(n\\to\\infty\\), the fifth-order pure nonlinearity, hexic homogeneous coefficient satisfies \\[ \\frac{E_{\\mathrm{ext}}^{(5)}}{E_{\\mathrm{tar}}^{(5)}} \\ge 45.739348964727\\ldots, \\qquad \\frac{E_{\\mathrm{tar}}^{(5)}}{E_{\\mathrm{all}}^{(5)}} \\le 0.0213952488032\\ldots . \\], where the decimals are computed from the unique positive root of an explicitly given sextic polynomial; uniqueness and global minimality are provided by sign changes and endpoint behavior.",
