  "记 \\(e=(1,1,1)\\) 且 \\(\\delta=4^{-n}\\)。把所有频率除以 \\(4^n\\) 后，四个正输入频率精确写成": "denote \\(e=(1,1,1)\\) and \\(\\delta=4^{-n}\\). After dividing all frequencies by \\(4^n\\), the four positive input frequencies are precisely written as",
