  "结构": "structure",
  "精确程序使用有理 Laurent 系数且不做零值裁剪；有限层程序使用原始单位极化和双精度向量。 两条计算路径在 \\(n=8\\) 已吻合到显示精度，降低了同一实现错误造成假闭式的风险。": "precise procedure uses rational Laurent coefficients and does not perform zero-value trimming; finite layer procedure uses original unit polarization and double-precision vectors. Two computational paths have already matched at the displayed precision in \\(n=8\\), reducing the risk of false closure due to the same implementation error.",
  "精确程序已经得到一般实振幅 \\(b,d\\) 下含 41 项的同阶能量多项式。 下一步先不增加时间阶数，而处理这个有限维全局优化问题：": "precise procedure has obtained a general real amplitude \\(b,d\\) under a 41-term homogeneous energy polynomial of the same order. Next step is not to increase time order but to handle this finite-dimensional global optimization problem:",
