  "两催化模态等幅、同相的实一参数族": "two catalytic modes in-phase, equal-amplitude real one-parameter family",
  "令 \\(X_\\infty=E_\\infty-T_\\infty\\)，再置 \\(z=\\varepsilon^2\\)。 \\(X_\\infty/T_\\infty\\) 的正驻点满足": "let \\(X_\\infty=E_\\infty-T_\\infty\\), then set \\(z=\\varepsilon^2\\). The positive stationary points of \\(X_\\infty/T_\\infty\\) satisfy",
  "令两种正频率催化振幅都为 \\(\\varepsilon\\)，负频率取共轭。 把第五阶六次齐次系数的极限 \\(\\dot H^{1/2}\\) 能量记为 \\(E_\\infty\\)。 精确聚合给出": "let both positive frequency catalytic amplitudes be \\(\\varepsilon\\), negative frequencies take conjugate. Denote the limit of the fifth-order hexic homogeneous coefficient energy \\(\\dot H^{1/2}\\) as \\(E_\\infty\\). Precise aggregation gives",
