  "\\(G_B\\) 仍是次数 \\((6,6,3)\\)、含 64 项的有理多项式。 自适应 de Casteljau 二分在深度 23 停止：24 个外部叶盒的全部 Bernstein 系数非负， 另有 1 个叶盒完全落入上一节已认证的局部盒。两类叶盒无缝覆盖整个单位立方体。": "\\(G_B\\) is still a degree \\((6,6,3)\\), a rational polynomial with 64 terms. Adaptive de Casteljau bisection stops at depth 23: all Bernstein coefficients of 24 external leaf boxes are non-negative, and one leaf box completely falls into the upper section already certified local box. Two types of leaf boxes seamlessly cover the entire unit cube.",
  "\\(N,M\\) 都与 \\(K\\) 正交，且 \\(N\\cdot M=0\\)、\\(|M|^2=|\\bar K|^2|N|^2\\)。 因此一个精确的局部单位极化曲线是": "\\(N,M\\) are both orthogonal to \\(K\\), and \\(N\\cdot M=0\\), \\(|M|^2=|\\bar K|^2|N|^2\\). Therefore, an exact local unit polarization curve is",
