  "传播到全部五层。基线有 306 个非零极限频率；微分会打开原来恰好为零的分量， 基线与四个导数合计出现 322 个非零极限频率。 五组聚合 Laurent 系列的所有负次幂都精确抵消。": "propagated to all five layers. The baseline has 306 non-zero limit frequencies; differentiation will open components that were originally zero, with the baseline and four derivatives totaling 322 non-zero limit frequencies. All negative powers of the aggregated Laurent series are precisely canceled.",
  "催化 \\(B\\)": "catalyst \\(B\\)",
