  "代数极小点的紧化坐标是 \\(z_*=\\alpha/(1+\\alpha)=0.14858627774169486\\ldots\\)，严格位于该盒内部。 这个盒在 \\((x,y)\\) 中被包含于 \\[ 0.17422579194591786\\le x\\le0.174648695153427, \\qquad 0\\le y\\le0.000170555366360769. \\]": "compact coordinates for the algebraic minimum point is \\(z_*=\\alpha/(1+\\alpha)=0.14858627774169486\\ldots\\), strictly located inside this box. This box is contained in \\((x,y)\\) within \\[ 0.17422579194591786\\le x\\le0.174648695153427, \\qquad 0\\le y\\le0.000170555366360769. \\]",
  "单位角导数": "unit corner derivative",
  "当前只证明固定极化不是驻点，还没有完成四角参数的全局优化。": "currently only proves that fixed polarization is not a stationary point; the global optimization for the four corner parameters has not been completed.",
  "导数直接穿过完整第五阶树": "the derivatives directly pass through the complete fifth-order tree",
  "第一项是固定极化下的全局代数定理。第二项是该定理边界上的精确一阶变分。 两者都只涉及第五阶有限相互作用模型，不是 Navier–Stokes 方程的全局正则性或奇性结论。": "the first term is the global algebraic theorem under fixed polarization. The second term is the exact first variation on the boundary of this theorem. Both involve only the fifth-order finite interaction model, not global regularity or singularity conclusions for Navier–Stokes equations.",
  "定理（固定极化的复振幅全局极小）。": "Theorem (fixed polarization complex amplitude global minimum).",
  "对 R0.11 的固定四个极化、任意不全为零的两个复催化振幅， \\[ \\frac{X_\\infty}{T_\\infty}\\ge\\lambda_* =45.73934896472748\\ldots, \\] 等号恰在 \\(\\beta=\\delta\\)、\\(4|\\beta|^2=\\alpha\\) 达到，其中 \\(\\alpha=0.17451712822713492\\ldots\\) 是一个显式六次多项式的唯一正根。 在这个极小点，四个单位角向极化导数全部严格非零，所以原固定极化不是完整极化空间中的局部极小点。": "for R0.11 with fixed four polarizations and any two non-zero complex amplitudes, \\[ \\frac{X_\\infty}{T_\\infty}\\ge\\lambda_* =45.73934896472748\\ldots, \\] equals exactly at \\(\\beta=\\delta\\) and \\(4|\\beta|^2=\\alpha\\), where \\(\\alpha=0.17451712822713492\\ldots\\) is the unique positive root of a specific sixth-degree polynomial. At this minimum point, all four unit angular polarization gradients are strictly non-zero, so the fixed polarization is not a local minimum in the full polarization space.",
  "对任意不全为零的 \\((\\beta,\\delta)\\in\\mathbb C^2\\)， R0.13 的第五阶纯非线性能量满足 \\[ \\frac{X_\\infty(\\beta,\\delta)}{T_\\infty(\\beta,\\delta)} \\ge\\lambda_*=45.73934896472748\\ldots . \\] 等号当且仅当 \\(\\beta=\\delta\\)、\\(4|\\beta|^2=\\alpha\\)，允许任意共同复相位。": "For every nonzero \\((\\beta,\\delta)\\in\\mathbb C^2\\), the fifth-order purely nonlinear energy in R0.13 satisfies \\[ \\frac{X_\\infty(\\beta,\\delta)}{T_\\infty(\\beta,\\delta)} \\ge\\lambda_*=45.73934896472748\\ldots . \\] Equality holds if and only if \\(\\beta=\\delta\\) and \\(4|\\beta|^2=\\alpha\\), with an arbitrary common complex phase allowed.",
  "符号": "symbol",
  "复极化自由度、热项、第五阶以后 Taylor 余项和有限时间误差；": "the complex phase cannot improve the target ratio for fixed polarizations;",
