  "输出包含目标正性、\\(\\alpha\\) 与 \\(\\lambda_*\\) 的 Sturm 隔离摘要、局部二阶导数和差商界、 24+1 个覆盖叶盒及分区哈希。": "The output includes target positivity, \\(\\alpha\\) and \\(\\lambda_*\\) Sturm isolation summary, local second derivatives and difference quotient bounds, 24+1 covering leaf boxes and partition hash.",
