  "四个正输入频率依次记为旧壳泵 \\(P,Q\\) 和本壳催化 \\(B,D\\)。 对其中一个频率写 \\(\\bar K(\\delta)=\\delta K(\\delta)\\)，固定极化分子写为 \\(N(\\delta)\\)，并定义": "The four positive input frequencies are sequentially denoted as old shell pump \\(P,Q\\) and new shell catalysis \\(B,D\\). For one frequency write \\(\\bar K(\\delta)=\\delta K(\\delta)\\), fix the polarized molecule as \\(N(\\delta)\\), and define",
