  "随后分别形成总能量、目标能量及其四个导数，并在代数振幅 \\(\\alpha\\) 的 80 位有理隔离区间上计算": "subsequently the total energy, target energy, and their four derivatives are formed and computed on an algebraic amplitude \\(\\alpha\\)'s 80-bit rational isolation interval",
  "所以 \\(D_0\\) 严格凸，并在 \\(\\alpha\\) 取得唯一零点。 对横向多项式 \\(J\\)，把局部长方体映到单位立方体。 它的次数为 \\((5,5,3)\\)，在 \\(\\lambda_*\\) 的两个有理隔离端点共检查 288 个 Bernstein 系数，得到": "So \\(D_0\\) is strictly convex and attains a unique zero at \\(\\alpha\\). For the transverse polynomial \\(J\\), map the local rectangular box to the unit cube. Its degree is \\((5,5,3)\\), and it checks 288 rational isolated endpoints of 288 Bernstein coefficients at \\(\\lambda_*\\), obtaining",
  "它重算完整第五阶带符号树，核对五组 Laurent 极点、四个次数 8 的导数分子、 精确反对称结构和单位角最速下降方向。两个程序的所有符号判断均使用有理数；小数只用于阅读。": "It recalculates a complete fifth-order signed tree, verifying five groups of Laurent poles, four eighth-degree derivative numerators, exact antisymmetric structure, and unit angular steepest descent direction. All symbolic judgments in both programs use rational numbers; decimals are only for reading.",
