  "我补上 R0.14 留下的局部代数证书，证明任意复催化振幅的全局最优点就是等幅同相点。 随后我把四个实输入极化分别沿无散切向量微分。固定 R0.11 极化不是第五阶外部/目标能量比的驻点， 因而下一步应优化极化，而不是继续调整振幅或相位。": "I supplement the local algebra certificate left by R0.14, proving that the global optimum for any complex catalytic amplitude is the in-phase equal-amplitude point. Then I differentiate each of the four real input polarizations along divergence-free tangential vector derivatives. With R0.11 polarization fixed not being a stationary point of the fifth-order external/target energy ratio, the next step should be to optimize polarization rather than continue adjusting amplitudes or phases.",
  "我没有对四个角做有限差分。对每个双线性节点 \\(\\mathcal B(U,V)\\)，导数按": "I do not perform finite differences on the four corners. For each bilinear node \\(\\mathcal B(U,V)\\), the derivative follows",
  "下降梯度只落在两组反对称旋转方向上。": "the descent gradient only falls on two groups of opposite symmetric rotation directions.",
  "先限制到两组反对称角，构造一个显式低于 \\(45.7393489647\\) 的有理或代数候选，并给出严格函数值区间。": "first restrict to two groups of opposite symmetric angles, construct an explicit rational or algebraic candidate below \\(45.7393489647\\) and provide a strict function value interval.",
