  "研究笔记 R0.15 · 复相位闭合与极化变分": "research note R0.15 · complex phase closure with polarization variation",
  "研究笔记 R0.15：用局部凸性、横向 Bernstein 差商和外部有理盒覆盖，证明任意复催化振幅的全局最优点就是等幅同相点；再计算四个输入极化的精确一阶变分。": "research note R0.15: using local convexity, horizontal Bernstein differences, and external rational boxes to cover, prove that the global optimum for any complex catalytic amplitude is the in-phase equal-amplitude point; then compute the exact first-order variations of the four input polarizations.",
  "一个局部盒加上完整补集": "a local box plus its complete complement",
  "一个自由度关闭，另一个自由度被确认有效": "one degree of freedom is closed, another is confirmed effective",
  "因而局部盒内 \\(D=D_0+yJ\\ge0\\)。等号要求同时有 \\(x=\\alpha\\) 和 \\(y=0\\)，此时约束自动给出 \\(h=0\\)。": "thus \\(D=D_0+yJ\\ge0\\) within the local box. The equality requires both \\(x=\\alpha\\) and \\(y=0\\) at once, giving \\(h=0\\) by constraint.",
  "因而缺口不是多算几位小数，而是零点附近的结构问题。 我把单位立方体分成一个含极小点的小有理盒及其补集：补集使用略高于极小值的有理界， 小盒则直接使用代数极小值 \\(\\lambda_*\\)。": "hence the gap is not due to more decimal places but a structural issue near the zero point. I divide the unit cube into a small rational box containing the minimum point and its complement: the complement uses a slightly higher rational bound, while the small box directly uses the algebraic minimum value \\(\\lambda_*\\).",
  "由 \\(\\lambda_*\\) 的定义和驻点方程， \\(D_0(\\alpha)=D_0'(\\alpha)=0\\)。 在上一节的整个 \\(x\\) 区间内，有理区间计算给出": "by the definition of \\(\\lambda_*\\) and the stationary point equation, \\(D_0(\\alpha)=D_0'(\\alpha)=0\\). In the entire interval \\(x\\) from the previous section, rational interval calculations give",
  "有理下界不能直接达到代数极小值": "the rational lower bound cannot directly reach the algebraic minimum value",
  "再检查其余两个角是否在新点重新打开，决定能否把全局搜索降到二维。": "recheck the other two angles to see if they are newly opened at the new point, deciding whether to reduce the global search to a two-dimensional one.",
  "在 \\(t=0\\) 的分子导数就是 \\(M\\)。泵极化的切向速度平方趋于 \\(1/12\\)， 催化极化的切向速度平方趋于 \\(1/3\\)。用这两个因子即可把 \\(t\\) 导数换成单位角导数。": "on \\(t=0\\), the molecular derivative is \\(M\\). The tangential velocity squared of the pump polarization tends to \\(1/12\\), while that of the catalytic polarization tends to \\(1/3\\). Using these factors allows for the replacement of the derivative of \\(t\\) with a unit angular derivative.",
  "在 \\(y=h=0\\) 上，令 \\(\\alpha\\) 为下列多项式的唯一正根：": "on \\(y=h=0\\), let \\(\\alpha\\) be the unique positive root of the following polynomial:",
  "在补集上 \\(X_\\infty/T_\\infty\\ge B>\\lambda_*\\)。 外部证书因此不仅排除更小值，也排除局部盒之外的等号。": "on the complement, \\(X_\\infty/T_\\infty\\ge B>\\lambda_*\\). The external certificate thus not only excludes smaller values but also excludes equality outside local boxes.",
  "这把 R0.14 的不到百万分之一间隙收紧为精确等号。 它同时说明振幅比、相对符号和复相位都不是固定极化模型中的有效改进方向。": "This R0.14 blade tightens the gap to an exact equality with a fraction less than one part per million. It simultaneously indicates that amplitude ratios, relative signs, and complex phases are not effective directions for improvement in the fixed polarization model.",
  "这不表示目标能量已经能够占优。它只说明“固定极化下最多约 2.14%”不是对极化扰动稳定的障碍， 下一阶段必须重新优化，而不能把 R0.15 的固定极化常数当作普适下界。": "this does not mean that the target energy has already taken precedence; it only indicates that \"at most about 2.14%\" under fixed polarization is not an obstruction to perturbations in polarization stability, requiring re-optimization in the next phase rather than treating R0.15 as a universal lower bound for fixed polarization constants.",
  "只有目标比例出现实质提高，才恢复热项和有限时间 Taylor 余项；否则记录新的极化下界。": "only when there is a substantial improvement in the target ratio will heat terms and finite-time Taylor remainder be restored; otherwise, a new polarization lower bound will be recorded.",
  "轴向严格凸，横向差商严格为正": "axial strict convexity, lateral divided differences strictly positive",
  "Clay 问题要求光滑解的全局存在，或构造满足正式条件的有限时间失效。 本文只对一个候选 Fourier 相互作用机制的有限阶系数做半代数分析。 我尚未完成关于这些特定代数常数和证书组合的文献优先权检索，也不主张新定理的优先权。": "the Clay problem requires either global existence of smooth solutions or construction of a finite-time failure satisfying formal conditions. This paper only performs semi-algebraic analysis on the finite-order coefficients of one candidate Fourier interaction mechanism. I have not yet completed a literature priority search regarding these specific algebraic constants and certificate combinations, nor do I claim priority for new theorems.",
  "R0.14 把两个复振幅化为 \\[ x=|\\beta+\\delta|^2,\\qquad y=|\\beta-\\delta|^2,\\qquad 0\\le h\\le xy, \\] 并得到 \\(45.739348\\le X_\\infty/T_\\infty\\le45.73934896472748\\ldots\\)。 左端是有理数，右端是代数数；把左端不断增加，只会使包含极小点的 Bernstein 盒出现负系数。": "R0.14 transforms two complex amplitudes into \\[ x=|\\beta+\\delta|^2,\\qquad y=|\\beta-\\delta|^2,\\qquad 0\\le h\\le xy, \\] and obtains \\(45.739348\\le X_\\infty/T_\\infty\\le45.73934896472748\\ldots\\). The left side is a rational number, while the right side is an algebraic number; increasing the left side will only lead to negative coefficients in the Bernstein box containing the minimum point.",
  "R0.14：双振幅全局优化与复相位 Bernstein 界": "R0.14: dual amplitude global optimization and complex phase Bernstein bound",
  "R0.15 已经给出方向，但还没有给出合适的有限步长。 因此下一项先做局部二阶控制和一个严格改善点，不直接声称全局极化优化完成。": "R0.15 has given a direction but not yet provided an appropriate finite step length. Therefore, the next item will perform local second-order control and one strict improvement point without directly claiming the completion of global polarization optimization.",
  "R0.15｜复振幅等号与极化一阶下降": "R0.15 | complex amplitude equality with first-order polarization decrease",
  "R0.16：沿反对称极化方向做联合优化": "R0.16: joint optimization along antisymmetric polarization direction",
  "Sturm 隔离给出唯一正根。90 位有理隔离区间同时证明 \\(\\lambda_*<45.739349\\)，严格余量大于 \\(3.527251566\\times10^{-8}\\)。": "Sturm isolation gives the unique positive root. A 90-digit rational isolation interval simultaneously proves \\(\\lambda_*<45.739349\\), with a strict remainder greater than \\(3.527251566\\times10^{-8}\\).",
