  "八个成对交换恒等式都由符号计算精确验证：两对梯度和、两对振幅混合导数和为零， 对角元和两类交叉元分别相等。因此对称与反对称扇区在二阶上精确分离。": "Eight pairwise commutation identities were precisely verified by symbolic computation: two pairs of gradients sum to zero, two pairs of amplitude mixed derivatives are zero. Diagonal elements and two types of off-diagonal elements are equal respectively. Thus symmetric and antisymmetric sectors are exactly separated at second order.",
