  "候选只在一条反对称有理路径上选取，不是全局最优性定理。": "candidates are selected only on one antisymmetric rational path and not as a global optimality theorem.",
  "计算结束后出现 326 个非零聚合频率。每个导数键的所有负 Laurent 次幂都精确为零。 因此 R0.15 的一阶方向确实来自可积的光滑极化曲线，二阶 Hessian 也不是由未消失奇项制造的假象。": "326 non-zero aggregated frequencies appear after computation. All negative Laurent powers of every derivative key are precisely zero. Therefore, the first-order direction of R0.15 indeed comes from an integrable smooth polarization curve, and the second-order Hessian is not a false impression caused by unvanishing singular terms.",
