  "目标比例约为旧固定极化最优值的 \\(2.455\\) 倍。 这足以否定“固定极化约 \\(2.14\\%\\) 是稳定障碍”，但距离目标能量占主导仍很远。": "target ratio is approximately \\(2.455\\) times the optimal value of old fixed polarization. This is sufficient to negate \"fixed polarization about \\(2.14\\%\\) is a stable obstruction\", but it is still far from the dominant energy proportion.",
