  "07 · 含义与边界": "07 · Meaning and boundaries",
  "八个交换恒等式由符号计算精确验证。两个公共方向组成对称二维块； 振幅 \\(x\\) 与两个反对称方向组成三维块。振幅与公共方向的混合项精确为零。": "Eight exchange identities are precisely verified by symbolic computation. Two common directions form a symmetric two-dimensional block; amplitude \\(x\\) with two antisymmetric directions forms a three-dimensional block. The mixed terms of amplitude and common direction are precisely zero.",
  "版本 v0.17 · 2026-08-16": "Version v0.17 · 2026-08-16",
  "本文仍只研究一个特定稀疏 Fourier 输入的第五阶纯非线性能量。 Clay 问题需要全局光滑性证明或满足正式条件的有限时间失效构造。 当前证书没有控制热耗散、高阶误差或完整 PDE 演化。": "This paper still only studies the fifth-order pure nonlinear energy for a specific sparse Fourier input. Clay problem requires global smoothness proof or finite-time failure construction satisfying formal conditions. Current certificates do not control viscous dissipation, high-order errors, or complete PDE evolution.",
  "泵与催化旋转不能继续共用一个尺度": "Pump and catalytic rotation cannot continue to share one scale",
  "比值降低": "Ratio reduction",
  "笔记状态 · 有理改进与联合正定性均为精确证书": "Note status · Rational improvement and joint positive definiteness are exact certificates",
