  "成对方向": "paired directions",
  "但初始搜索把 \\(m,n\\) 绑在同一比例上。 在 R0.16 有限点重新传播完整单位归一化的一阶导数后，泵与催化修正具有相反要求： 一个应减小，另一个应增大。振幅方向当时已几乎调平。": "but the initial search binds \\(m,n\\) at the same ratio. After repropagation of fully normalized first derivatives at finite points R0.16, the pump and catalytic corrections have opposite requirements: one should decrease while the other should increase. The amplitude direction was nearly flattened at that time.",
  "第五阶目标比例提高到 5.95187%；整洁候选处五维联合 Hessian 由精确主子式证明正定。": "the fifth-order target ratio is increased to 5.95187%; the five-dimensional joint Hessian at clean candidates is proven positive definite by exact leading principal minors.",
  "独立调节泵与催化极化能严格改善 R0.16 候选。": "independent regulation of pump and catalytic polarization strictly improves R0.16 candidates.",
  "对称 2×2": "symmetric 2×2",
  "对称二维块和反对称—振幅三维块分别使用 Sylvester 判据。 按所选基底，所需的顺序主子式为": "symmetric two-dimensional blocks and antisymmetric—amplitude three-dimensional blocks are used with Sylvester criterion respectively. The required sequence of leading principal minors for the chosen basis is",
  "对第 2 节的有限有理极化与振幅， \\[ \\frac{X_\\infty}{T_\\infty} =15.801443619697901\\ldots <\\frac{158015}{10000}. \\] 目标能量比例为 \\(5.951869509758118\\ldots\\%\\)，严格大于 \\(5.9518\\%\\)。 在第 4 节的邻近整洁有理点，五变量联合 Hessian 严格正定。": "for the finite rational polarization and amplitude in Section 2, the target energy ratio for \\[ \\frac{X_\\infty}{T_\\infty} =15.801443619697901\\ldots <\\frac{158015}{10000}. \\] is \\(5.951869509758118\\ldots\\%\\), strictly greater than \\(5.9518\\%\\). At the nearby clean rational point in Section 4, the five-variable joint Hessian is strictly positive definite.",
  "二次型值": "quadratic form values",
  "二阶传播选用邻近的整洁点": "second-order propagation selects neighboring clean points",
  "二阶结论。": "second-order conclusions.",
  "反对称—振幅 3×3": "antisymmetric—amplitude 3×3",
  "反对称三变量中的精确代数驻点及其唯一性；": "exact algebraic stationary points and their uniqueness in the antisymmetric three-variables;",
