  "复极化、热项、Taylor 余项、稠密包和逐壳重复；": "complex polarization, heat terms, Taylor remainder, dense packets, and shell-by-shell repetition;",
  "该点的外部/目标比是 \\(15.802476770259613\\ldots\\)， 与精细点相差约 \\(0.00103315\\)。15 组零阶、一阶和二阶 Laurent 系列的负幂全部精确抵消。": "the external/target ratio at this point is \\(15.802476770259613\\ldots\\), differing from the fine points by about \\(0.00103315\\).15 negative powers of all zeroth, first, and second Laurent series are precisely canceled.",
