  "。HTML、PDF 与可复现脚本保持在同一提交中。": ". HTML, PDF, and reproducible scripts are kept in the same submission.",
  "“局部”不能删去。这里没有排除远处的其他驻点，也没有比较参数域边界。 结论只属于第五阶有限代数模型，不是 Navier–Stokes 正则性或奇性结果。": "\"Local\" cannot be omitted. Here, distant other stationary points are not excluded, and parameter domain boundaries are not compared. The conclusion only belongs to the fifth-order finite algebraic model, not to Navier–Stokes regularity or singularity results.",
