  "11 · 资料": "11 · Materials",
  "把 \\(p,q\\) 作为多项式变量直接传播过完整有符号第五阶 Laurent 树。令": "Take \\(p,q\\) as a polynomial variable and directly propagate over the complete signed fifth-order Laurent tree. Let",
  "把两个共同转动方向的二阶块写成 \\((p,q,x)\\) 的显式有理函数。": "Write both second-order blocks with common rotational directions as explicit rational functions of \\((p,q,x)\\).",
  "版本 v0.18 · 2026-08-16": "Version v0.18 · 2026-08-16",
  "半径 \\(10^{-30}\\) 的盒严格包含自身像": "Half-space with radius \\(10^{-30}\\) strictly contains its own image",
  "半径 10^-30 的有理盒内存在唯一反对称驻点；该驻点在三变量子空间中是严格局部极小。": "Within a rational box of radius 10^-30, there exists a unique antisymmetric stationary point; this stationary point is strictly locally minimal in the triad subspace.",
  "本笔记保留 \\((p,q,x)\\)，没有把奇次项丢掉。 这也解释了为什么 R0.17 的反对称方向一阶导数非零。": "This note retains \\((p,q,x)\\) without discarding odd terms. This also explains why the first derivative of the antisymmetric direction for R0.17 is non-zero.",
  "笔记状态 · 局部存在、唯一性与三变量正定性已证明": "notes status · local existence, uniqueness, and positive definiteness of three variables have been proven",
  "变量校正。": "variable correction.",
  "初始设想是改用 \\(P=p^2,Q=q^2\\)。精确传播否定了这一步： 等幅能量中有非零的 \\(p,p^3,\\ldots\\) 与 \\(q,q^3,\\ldots\\) 项。 R0.17 的成对 Hessian 分块只是在反对称点处的局部交换结构， 不能推出 \\(R(-p,q,x)=R(p,q,x)\\) 或 \\(R(p,-q,x)=R(p,q,x)\\)。": "initial idea was to switch to \\(P=p^2,Q=q^2\\). precise propagation negated this step: among the constant amplitude energies, there are non-zero \\(p,p^3,\\ldots\\) and \\(q,q^3,\\ldots\\) terms. The R0.17 paired Hessian block is only a local exchange structure at antisymmetric points and cannot imply \\(R(-p,q,x)=R(p,q,x)\\) or \\(R(p,-q,x)=R(p,q,x)\\).",
  "从 \\(c\\) 转移到 \\(z_*\\) 的九个逐项误差上界都小于 \\(4.53\\times10^{-28}\\)。扣除这些误差后，三行的严格对角占优余量仍为": "upper bounds for the nine individual errors when transitioning from \\(c\\) to \\(z_*\\) are all less than \\(4.53\\times10^{-28}\\). After deducting these errors, the strict diagonal dominance of the three rows remains",
  "但这个有理点与 \\(z_*\\) 的坐标差约为 \\((-9.69\\times10^{-4},\\ 1.01\\times10^{-3},\\ 3.96\\times10^{-4})\\)。 正定矩阵的连续性只说明“足够近”时符号保持；若没有给出明确邻域， 它不是区间证明。因此完整五维局部极小仍列为开放项。": "But this rational point differs from the coordinates of \\(z_*\\) by about \\((-9.69\\times10^{-4},\\ 1.01\\times10^{-3},\\ 3.96\\times10^{-4})\\). The continuity of a positive definite matrix only implies that the sign is preserved when \"close enough\"; without specifying an explicit neighborhood, it is not a proof over an interval. Therefore, the complete five-dimensional local minimum remains open.",
  "第五阶反对称三变量商有一个经过区间认证的局部唯一驻点。": "there is a locally unique critical point for the fifth-order antisymmetric trivariate quotient with certified intervals.",
  "对称矩阵具有正对角元并严格按行对角占优，因此正定。 这给出第 0 节的反对称严格局部极小结论。": "symmetric matrices with positive diagonal elements and strict row-wise diagonal dominance are positive definite. This gives the conclusion of antisymmetric strict local minima in section 0.",
  "对象：第五阶有限代数模型": "object: fifth-order finite algebraic model",
  "多项式": "polynomial",
  "反对称-振幅块第二主子式": "antisymmetric-amplitude block second leading principal minor",
  "反对称-振幅块第一主子式": "antisymmetric-amplitude block first leading principal minor",
  "反对称-振幅块行列式": "antisymmetric-amplitude block determinant",
