  "。本笔记从其严格局部极值出发，处理其余根与全部边界。": ". This note starts from its strict local extremum to handle the remaining roots and all boundaries.",
  "。给出原始三变量商、精确驻点系统和第一个根盒。": ". provides the original three-variable quotient, precise stationary system and first root box.",
  "。用于核对 Clay 问题的正式范围。": ". for verification of the formal range of the Clay problem.",
  "。HTML、PDF、精确脚本、证书包和附图保持在同一仓库中。": ". HTML, PDF, precise scripts, certificate packages and illustrations are kept in the same repository.",
  "\\((p,q,x)\\) 的盒中心": "\\((p,q,x)\\) center",
  "\\(J\\) 在紧化闭包上连续。其正内部恰有两个驻点；根 I 为严格局部最大，根 II 为鞍点。 所有边界闭包的最大值不超过 \\(3.280940959752690\\ldots\\%\\)，而根 I 的值位于 \\(5.9518698677219236\\ldots\\%\\) 的认证区间内。因此根 I 是 \\([0,\\infty]^3\\) 上 \\(J\\) 的唯一全局最大点。": "\\(J\\) is continuous on the compactified closure. Its positive interior has exactly two stationary points; root I is a strict local maximum, and root II is a saddle point. The maximum values of all boundary closures do not exceed \\(3.280940959752690\\ldots\\%\\), while the value of root I lies within the certified interval of \\(5.9518698677219236\\ldots\\%\\). Therefore, root I is the unique global maximum point on \\([0,\\infty]^3\\) for \\(J\\).",
  "\\(T\\) 是目标频率能量，\\(E\\) 是模型中其余频率的能量。 R0.18 使用的外部/目标比 \\(R=E/T\\) 与这里的目标比例满足 \\(J=1/(1+R)\\)， 所以 \\(R\\) 的极小点就是 \\(J\\) 的极大点。为处理全部无穷端，我使用射影坐标": "\\(T\\) is the target-frequency energy, and \\(E\\) is the energy in all other model frequencies. The external-to-target ratio \\(R=E/T\\) used in R0.18 and the target share here satisfy \\(J=1/(1+R)\\), so a minimizer of \\(R\\) is a maximizer of \\(J\\). To cover all points at infinity, I use projective coordinates",
  "\\(x=0\\) 或 \\(x=\\infty\\)": "\\(x=0\\) or \\(x=\\infty\\)",
