  "把 R0.18–R0.19 的一个局部候选升级为有完整边界处理的有限模型唯一全局最优点。": "Elevate a local candidate in R0.18–R0.19 to the unique global optimum of a fully bounded finite model.",
  "把粘性热因子保留在每棵树的时间积分中，求出目标增长仍为正的严格时间窗。": "Preserve the viscous thermal factor in each tree's time integral, deriving a strict time window where target growth remains positive.",
  "版本 v0.20 · 2026-08-17": "Version v0.20 · 2026-08-17",
  "笔记状态 · 计算机辅助有限模型定理": "Note status · Theorem with computer-assisted finite model",
  "边界": "Boundary",
  "边界闭包": "Boundary closure",
  "参数闭包：\\([0,\\infty]^3\\)": "Parameter closure: \\([0,\\infty]^3\\)",
  "第五阶截断没有自动控制第六阶及以上的非线性余项。": "Fifth-order truncation does not automatically control nonlinear remainders of sixth order and higher.",
  "第一轮分别由三个方程排除 584、268、483 个叶盒；独立种子轮为 858、379、498 个。 两轮从不同初始划分到达相同的根盒、条带与零未决结论。 这不是通过密集采样“没有看见其他根”，而是对覆盖整个紧立方体的盒族逐盒给出符号证书。": "The first round excludes 584, 268, and 483 leaf boxes by three equations each; independent seed rounds have 858, 379, and 498 leaf boxes. Both rounds reach the same root box, strips, and zero undecided conclusions from different initial partitions. This is not through dense sampling \"not seeing other roots,\" but by giving symbolic certificates for a family of boxes covering the entire compact cube.",
  "对 R0.18–R0.19 所定义的正三参数第五阶商，令 \\[ J(p,q,x)=\\frac{T(p,q,x)}{T(p,q,x)+E(p,q,x)}, \\qquad (p,q,x)\\in(0,\\infty)^3. \\] 把 \\(J\\) 连续延拓到紧化闭包 \\([0,\\infty]^3\\)。该闭包上存在唯一全局最大点； 它位于第 3 节第一个根盒内。正内部只有另一个驻点，且它是非退化鞍点。": "For the positive three-parameter fifth-order quotient defined in R0.18–R0.19, extend \\(J\\) continuously to the compactified closure \\([0,\\infty]^3\\), making \\[ J(p,q,x)=\\frac{T(p,q,x)}{T(p,q,x)+E(p,q,x)}, \\qquad (p,q,x)\\in(0,\\infty)^3. \\] exist with a unique global maximum; it is located within the first root box of Section 3. The positive interior has only another critical point, which is a nondegenerate saddle.",
  "对极化、振幅与相位的横向扰动给出统一稳定半径，明确哪些有限维限制仍是开放缺口。": "Provide a unified stable radius for transverse perturbations in polarization, amplitude, and phase, clarifying which finite-dimensional restrictions are still open gaps.",
