  "建立了可复用的证书链：精确稀疏代数、Krawczyk 根盒、resultant/RUR 边界分类与全局 Bernstein 排除。": "a reusable certificate chain: precise sparse algebra, Krawczyk root box, resultant/RUR boundary classification, and global Bernstein exclusion.",
  "建议先运行证书包中的 SHA-256 校验，再重算根盒、边界与全局细分； 两个全局 JSON 应同时报告": "it is recommended to run the SHA-256 checksum from the certificate package first, then recalculate the root box, boundaries, and global subdivision; both global JSON reports should be simultaneously provided",
  "结尾；该部分在 DGX Spark 上运行。 全局细分使用本机 Python 3.12.13、NumPy 2.3.5 与 8 个进程。 正式附图包包含 CSV、来源摘要、绘图脚本、PDF/SVG/600 dpi PNG、caption、manifest 和独立数据校验器。": "ends in; this part was run on a DGX Spark. The global subdivision used local Python 3.12.13, NumPy 2.3.5, and eight processes. The figure package contains the CSV data, source summary, plotting scripts, PDF/SVG/600 dpi PNG files, caption, manifest, and an independent data validator.",
  "紧致性把驻点分类与边界比较拼成全局结论": "tightness classifies fixed points and compares with boundary to form a global conclusion",
  "连同边后的闭包最大值": "maximum of the closure including the boundary",
  "两次独立种子划分都以零未决盒结束": "both independent seed partitions end with undecided boxes at zero",
  "两个根盒各含唯一根；其余正内部由完整 Bernstein 细分排除。": "each root box contains a unique root; the rest of the positive internal regions are excluded by complete Bernstein subdivision.",
  "两个盒的半径均为 \\(10^{-6}\\)。根 I 的最大 Krawczyk 包含比约为 \\(0.002263\\)， 根 II 约为 \\(0.129179\\)，都严格小于 1。 根 I 的商 Hessian 在整个盒上正定，所以 \\(E/T\\) 严格局部最小、\\(J\\) 严格局部最大； 根 II 的有理测试方向给出异号二次型，从而认证为鞍点。": "Both boxes have radius \\(10^{-6}\\). The maximum Krawczyk inclusion ratio is about \\(0.002263\\) for root I and \\(0.129179\\) for root II; both are strictly below 1. The quotient Hessian at root I is positive definite throughout the box, so \\(E/T\\) has a strict local minimum and \\(J\\) has a strict local maximum. A rational test direction at root II gives an indefinite quadratic form, certifying a saddle point.",
  "两个内部驻点、完整边界分类和零未决盒的全局排除；结论严格限定于所选第五阶有限模型。": "a global exclusion of two internal stationary points, complete boundary classification, and no undecided boxes; conclusions are strictly limited to the selected fifth-order finite model.",
  "两个退化点用加权放大与有限宽条带处理": "two degenerate points are handled by weighted amplification and finite-width bands",
  "两个严格符号均由有理张量 Bernstein 系数证明，且覆盖被全局立方体细分委托出去的两个 dyadic 核。 因此退化线附近也没有遗漏内部公共根。": "each strict sign is proven by rational tensor Bernstein coefficients and covers two dyadic kernels delegated for global cubic subdivision. Therefore, no internal common roots are missed near the degeneration line.",
  "没有得到任何三维 Navier–Stokes 全局正则性、奇性形成或 Clay 问题结论。": "no three-dimensional Navier–Stokes global regularity, singularity formation, or Clay problem conclusions were obtained.",
  "每个候选根由有理 Krawczyk 盒认证存在且唯一；根盒和两个退化边界条带以外的每个盒， 至少有一个驻点多项式的 Bernstein 系数区间严格同号。两条路径合并后才得到全域结论。": "each candidate root is certified to exist and be unique by rational Krawczyk boxes; in each box outside the root box and two degenerate boundary strips, at least one interval of the stationary polynomial's Bernstein coefficients strictly has the same sign. The two paths merge to obtain a global conclusion.",
  "面内局部最大值 \\(J\\times100\\)": "in-plane local maximum value \\(J\\times100\\)",
  "目标能量比例最大值为 \\(5.9518698677219236\\ldots\\%\\)。": "target energy ratio maximum is \\(5.9518698677219236\\ldots\\%\\).",
  "目标频率比例的有限阶增长没有证明可以跨壳重复，也没有压倒粘性热衰减。": "finite-order growth of target frequency ratios cannot be proven to repeat across shells and does not overwhelm viscosity viscous decay.",
  "内部驻点由三个商导数分子给出：": "internal stationary points are given by three quotient derivatives' numerators:",
  "恰有两个正内部驻点": "exactly two positive internal nodes",
