  "当前结果证明了所选稀疏锥形初值族的有限阶系数、频率支持几何和模式级算子恒等式。 它没有证明三维 Navier–Stokes 解的全局正则性或有限时奇性，也没有证明一次目标传递可以跨尺度重复。": "The current results prove the finite order coefficients, frequency support geometry, and mode-level operator identities of the selected sparse cone initial data family. It does not prove global regularity or finite time singularity for three-dimensional Navier–Stokes solutions, nor does it prove that one target transfer can be repeated across scales.",
  "定义纵向半范数": "Define longitudinal semi-norm",
  "独立的 complex128 递推计算了壳层 \\(n=3,4,5\\) 的完整粘性 Taylor 系数至十二阶。 三个运行在十二阶都得到 4,772 个非零 Fourier 模；其 Fourier \\(\\ell^1\\) 根指标分别为 3.08898、3.10146 和 3.10229。": "Independent complex128 recursive computation of full viscous Taylor coefficients up to the twelfth order for shell \\(n=3,4,5\\). Three runs all obtained 4,772 non-zero Fourier modes; their Fourier \\(\\ell^1\\) root indices were 3.08898, 3.10146, and 3.10229.",
  "对 \\(|u|+L_\\delta(u)\\) 建立完整卷积不等式，并追踪最优常数。": "Establish a complete convolution inequality for \\(|u|+L_\\delta(u)\\) and track the optimal constants.",
  "估计闭合后，把十二阶近似解、区间残差和标量控制方程接到同一证书链。": "After closing the estimate, attach the twelfth order approximate solution, interval residuals, and scalar control equations to the same certificate chain.",
