  "令 \\(\\delta=4^{-n}\\) 且 \\(\\tau=\\delta^{-2}t\\)。目标 Fourier 系数写成": "let \\(\\delta=4^{-n}\\) and \\(\\tau=\\delta^{-2}t\\). target Fourier coefficients written as",
  "六阶项只来自一次热插入。七阶项由两次热插入与八叶纯非线性树共同组成； 其相对五阶的三个已认证分量约为 \\(+3.58634\\)、\\(-5.86797\\) 和 \\(-0.53281\\)。 所有负 Laurent 幂精确抵消，所得向量严格落在目标极化直线上。": "Sixth-order terms only come from a single thermal insertion. Seventh-order terms are composed of twice the thermal insertion and an eight-leaf purely nonlinear tree; their relative fifth-order three certified components are approximately \\(+3.58634\\), \\(-5.86797\\), and \\(-0.53281\\). All negative Laurent powers precisely cancel out, resulting in a vector that strictly lies on the target polarization line.",
