  "若只有一阶半径损失，构造时间 Taylor 主级数；若出现二阶损失，检查热半群或更细的结构性抵消。": "Assuming only first-order radius loss, construct the time Taylor main series; if second-order loss occurs, check the heat semigroup or finer structural cancellation.",
  "十二阶近似解残差的外向区间上界和完整 Taylor 尾。": "The outer interval upper bound and complete Taylor tail of the twelfth-order approximate solution residual.",
  "十二阶数值结果只用于选择下一条证明路线": "The numerical results at the twelfth order are only used for selecting the next proof route",
  "所以目标模的时间零至四阶即使加入热项仍为零；第五阶等于 R0.20 的纯非线性项； 六阶没有七叶纯非线性贡献；七阶才第一次出现新的八叶纯非线性树。": "so the target mode's time zero to fourth order remains zero even with the heat term added; the fifth order equals the pure nonlinear term R0.20; the sixth order has no seven-petal pure nonlinear contribution; it is only in the seventh order that a new eight-petal pure nonlinear tree appears.",
  "我把 R0.20 的最优有限模型放回带热算子的时间 Taylor 递推， 精确认证目标模的前两项粘性修正，并证明薄锥频率的模式级大参数抵消。 无限 Taylor 尾还没有闭合，因此这里发布的是进展记录，不是 PDE 定理。": "I place the optimal finite model with R0.20 back into the time Taylor recursion with the heat operator, precisely confirming the first two viscosity corrections of the target mode, and proving that the parameters at large modes in a narrow cone frequency cancel out. The infinite Taylor tail is not yet closed, so this is recorded as progress, not a PDE theorem.",
