  "在有理坐标 \\(G(c,\\beta)=(6c,3\\beta_1,3\\beta_2)\\) 中，八个 signed 输入恰好是 \\(\\{\\varepsilon_1a+\\varepsilon_2b+\\varepsilon_3c\\}\\)，其中每个 \\(\\varepsilon_j\\in\\{-1,1\\}\\)，且": "in the rational coordinates \\(G(c,\\beta)=(6c,3\\beta_1,3\\beta_2)\\), eight signed inputs are exactly \\(\\{\\varepsilon_1a+\\varepsilon_2b+\\varepsilon_3c\\}\\), where each is \\(\\varepsilon_j\\in\\{-1,1\\}\\),",
