  "这些数值随壳层趋于稳定，支持“存在壳层一致估计”的工作假设。 但它们没有外向舍入，也没有覆盖所有更高时间阶，因此不参与严格符号结论。": "these values stabilize as the shells approach, supporting the working hypothesis of \"existence of consistent shell estimates.\" However, they do not have outward rounding and do not cover all higher time orders, so they are not involved in strict sign conclusions.",
  "这一阶段主要是精确代数和函数空间估计，不需要大规模 GPU。 大量参数盒或十二阶区间残差扫描开始前，再根据基准测试决定是否使用 DGX。": "this phase is mainly about precise algebra and function space estimates, requiring no large-scale GPU. A significant parameter box or a scan for 12th-order interval residuals precedes this based on benchmark testing to decide whether to use DGX.",
  "只有在 \\(\\mathcal R_{\\geq8}\\) 的严格上界小于前三项给出的目标下界之后， 这个有限阶展开才能升级为完整粘性解的非零目标传递结论。": "only after the strict upper bound of \\(\\mathcal R_{\\geq8}\\) is less than the target lower bound given by the first three terms can this finite-order expansion be upgraded to a non-zero target transfer conclusion for a full viscous solution.",
