  "版本 v0.22 · 2026-08-18": "version v0.22 · 2026-08-18",
  "本笔记证明全空间欧氏—纵向模式范数具有尖锐二阶解析半径损失。它没有证明所选初值的 Taylor 尾发散，也没有证明三维 Navier–Stokes 的全局正则性或有限时奇性。": "This note proves the loss of a sharp second-order analyticity radius for the full-space Euclidean—longitudinal mode norm. It does not prove the divergence of the Taylor tail for the chosen initial data, nor does it prove global regularity or finite-time singularity for three-dimensional Navier–Stokes.",
  "不过，尖锐极化 \\(w_A,w_B\\) 是为全空间反例专门选择的。当前尚未证明它们由原始八个极化经过真实 Taylor 递推产生。若实际生成子空间始终避开这些方向，仍可能得到更好的闭合。": "However, the sharp polarizations \\(w_A,w_B\\) were chosen specifically for the full-space counterexample. I have not proved that the true Taylor recurrence generates them from the original eight polarizations. If the generated subspace always avoids these directions, a better closure may still be possible.",
