  "热率为 \\(3q^2+\\delta^2|\\beta|^2\\)。沿上述 \\(\\delta_N\\)，两个输入热率趋于 \\(1/12\\)，输出趋于 \\(1/3\\)，横向热率趋于零。因此它们不会随 \\(N^2\\) 增长，不能一致补偿尖锐损失。": "heat rate for \\(3q^2+\\delta^2|\\beta|^2\\). Along the above \\(\\delta_N\\), both input heat rates tend to \\(1/12\\), output tends to \\(1/3\\), and lateral heat rates tend to zero. Therefore they do not grow with \\(N^2\\) and cannot consistently compensate for sharp losses.",
