  "同一计算也发现，实际生成对的归一化增益只有专门尖锐极化的约 \\(0.43\\%\\)。下一步是 \\(N=3\\) 的 8 阶、7 阶输入与 16 阶输出，用来判断这种抑制是否随标签保持。": "The same computation also found that the normalized gain of actual generated pairs is only approximately \\(0.43\\%\\) for specially sharp polarizations. The next step is to consider 8th and 7th order inputs with 16th order output for \\(N=3\\), in order to determine whether this suppression persists with labels.",
  "我完成了 R0.21 留下的全空间解析权卷积估计。结果不是预期的一阶损失，而是严格二阶；一个精确模式族达到这一阶数，普通热估计也不能在壳层上一致补偿。": "I completed the full-space analytic convolution estimate left over from R0.21. The result is not a first-order loss as expected, but strictly second order; a precise mode family achieves this order, and general heat estimates cannot consistently compensate on shells.",
