  "Navier–Stokes 开放研究日志 · R0.22": "Navier–Stokes Open Research Log · R0.22",
  "R0.21 排除了显式 \\(4^n\\) 损失；R0.22 又证明，剩余标签增长在全空间里仍然达到二阶。继续机械增加 Taylor 阶数不会解决这个问题。": "R0.21 excluded the explicit \\(4^n\\) loss; R0.22 proved that the remaining label growth still reaches second order in the full space. Continuing to mechanically increase Taylor orders will not solve this issue.",
  "R0.21：带粘性低阶修正与薄锥抵消": "R0.21: viscous low-order correction with narrow cone cancellation",
  "R0.22 完整引理原稿": "R0.22 full lemma draft",
  "R0.22｜解析半径二阶损失的尖锐障碍": "R0.22｜sharp obstruction to second order loss of analyticity",
  "R0.23 已完成第一次检查。\\(N=2\\) 的尖锐标签可达，两个实际输入的尖锐方向投影都精确非零，对称根相互作用也不精确抵消；因此简单的子空间排除机制不存在。": "R0.23 has completed its first check. Sharp tags for \\(N=2\\) are reachable; the sharp projections of both actual inputs are exactly nonzero, and symmetric root interactions are not exactly canceled either; hence a simple subspace exclusion mechanism does not exist.",
  "。证书保存二次域基坐标、全部支持计数、精确零判断和有限壳层误差。": ". The certificate records coordinates in a quadratic-number-field basis, all support counts, exact zero tests, and finite-shell errors.",
  "\\(N=2\\) 已经进入真实生成系数": "\\(N=2\\) has entered the real generated coefficients",
  "01 · 精确代数": "01 · precise algebra",
  "02 · 首次相遇": "02 · First encounter",
