  "作用。": "Purpose.",
  "Navier–Stokes 开放研究日志 · R0.23": "Navier–Stokes Open Research Log · R0.23",
  "R0.20 归一化只引入一个相对权重": "R0.20 normalization introduces only one relative weight",
  "R0.22 后最直接的希望，是八个初始模态生成的系数始终与尖锐方向正交。R0.23 已排除这一点。": "After R0.22, the most direct hope was that the coefficients generated by the eight initial modes would always remain orthogonal to the sharp direction. R0.23 rules this out.",
  "R0.22：解析半径二阶损失的尖锐障碍": "R0.22: Sharp obstruction causing a second-order loss in the radius of analyticity",
  "R0.23 完整数学说明": "R0.23 Complete mathematical explanation",
  "R0.23｜尖锐方向确实出现，但首个增益很弱": "R0.23｜The sharp direction indeed appears, but the first gain is very weak",
  "R0.23｜真实生成系数的首次尖锐标签检查": "R0.23｜First sharp label check for true generated coefficients",
  "R0.24 已完成 \\(N=3\\) 的 8 阶、7 阶输入与 16 阶输出。极端面选择律把目标严格限制在闭合二维递推中；三个 R0.23 系数也得到逐项精确复现。": "R0.24 completes the order-8 and order-7 inputs and the order-16 output for \\(N=3\\). An extreme-face selection rule confines the target exactly to a closed two-dimensional recurrence; it also reproduces the three R0.23 coefficients exactly, component by component.",
  "，包含逐阶支持数、精确系数、回归结果、检查点元数据与有限壳层误差。": ", containing per-order support counts, exact coefficients, regression results, checkpoint metadata, and finite-shell errors.",
  "\\(N=3\\) 仍未复制": "\\(N=3\\) still does not reproduce",
  "\\(N=3\\) 投影非零": "Nonzero projection at \\(N=3\\)",
  "01 · 极端面选择律": "01 · extreme-face selection rule",
  "02 · 精确递推": "02 · exact recurrence",
  "03 · N=3 结果": "03 · N=3 result",
