  "05 · 独立核对": "05 · independent check",
  "8 阶、7 阶与 16 阶系数": "Order-8, order-7, and order-16 coefficients",
  "版本 v0.24 · 2026-08-18": "Version v0.24 · 2026-08-18",
  "闭合二维边界递推、GMP 十六阶证书，以及 N=2 到 N=3 的严格有限比较。": "A closed two-dimensional boundary recurrence, a GMP order-16 certificate, and a rigorous finite comparison from N=2 to N=3.",
  "边界面递推闭合": "Closed boundary-face recurrence",
  "从 \\(N=2\\) 到 \\(N=3\\)，真实增益只增加约 \\(18.7\\%\\)，半径乘积归一化后约减半。该根分裂在完整输出中的份额缩小约 593 倍。": "From \\(N=2\\) to \\(N=3\\), the generated gain rises by only about \\(18.7\\%\\), while the radius-product-normalized value is roughly halved. The share of this root split in the full output shrinks by about a factor of 593.",
  "等号迫使每个叶子的第二坐标都是 \\(-1\\)。树根若分成 \\(L_1+L_2=L\\)，两个子树也必须分别达到 \\(-L_1,-L_2\\)。因此 \\(m_2=-L\\) 构成逐阶闭合的二维递推面，面外历史不可能贡献目标。": "Equality forces the second coordinate of every leaf to be \\(-1\\). If a tree root splits as \\(L_1+L_2=L\\), the two subtrees must attain \\(-L_1,-L_2\\), respectively. Thus \\(m_2=-L\\) forms a two-dimensional recurrence face that closes at every order, and no off-face history can contribute to the target.",
  "递推仍在 R0.23 的二次域 \\(\\mathbb Q(t)\\) 中进行。程序使用 gmpy2 2.3.1 与 GMP 6.3.0；每完成一阶，就原子写入标签、二次域基坐标、根证书哈希和散度约束。": "The recurrence still takes place in the R0.23 quadratic field \\(\\mathbb Q(t)\\). The program uses gmpy2 2.3.1 and GMP 6.3.0; after each completed order it atomically writes the labels, quadratic-field coordinates, root-certificate hash, and divergence constraint.",
  "独立有限-\\(\\delta\\) Leray 递推在壳层 3、5、7 上逐级收敛。壳层 7 的三个 \\(N=3\\) 系数最大横向相对误差为 \\(1.163\\times10^{-3}\\)，最大纵向相对误差为 \\(6.513\\times10^{-6}\\)。": "The independent finite-\\(\\delta\\) Leray recurrence converges across shell levels 3, 5, and 7. At level 7, the three \\(N=3\\) coefficients have maximum relative transverse error \\(1.163\\times10^{-3}\\) and maximum relative longitudinal error \\(6.513\\times10^{-6}\\).",
  "复现 R0.23": "Reproduce R0.23",
  "该根分裂占完整输出": "This root split's share of the full output",
  "根贡献与完整输出的横向余弦平方仍为 \\(0.891409\\ldots\\)。份额变小主要是其他树历史的幅值层级，不是最终方向近乎正交。": "The squared transverse cosine between the root contribution and the full output remains \\(0.891409\\ldots\\). The smaller share mainly reflects the amplitude hierarchy of other tree histories, not near orthogonality in the final directions.",
  "后续的极化通道分解证明：四个通道按 \\(N^2,N,N,1\\) 分层，唯一的二次项是两个归一化尖锐坐标的乘积。若它们各自是 \\(O(N^{-1})\\)，真实增益就一致有界。": "The subsequent polarization-channel decomposition proves that the four channels scale as \\(N^2,N,N,1\\), with the product of the two normalized sharp coordinates as the only quadratic term. If each is \\(O(N^{-1})\\), the generated gain is uniformly bounded.",
  "继续阅读 R0.25：边界面极化通道约化 →": "Continue with R0.25: boundary-face polarization-channel reduction →",
  "尖锐方向没有被选择律排除。": "The selection rule does not exclude the sharp direction.",
  "尖锐方向余弦平方": "Squared cosine with the sharp direction",
  "尖锐横向分量依然很明显，但两个模式范数仍由纵向 jet 主导。当前抑制不是来自逐渐正交。": "The sharp transverse components remain substantial, but both mode norms are still dominated by their longitudinal jets. The current suppression does not come from increasing orthogonality.",
  "结论位于 R0.20 有理根中心，只覆盖纯非线性最小叶系数。它不覆盖根盒、热项或无限 Taylor 尾，也没有证明三维 Navier–Stokes 的全局正则性或有限时奇性。": "The conclusion is at the rational center of the R0.20 root and covers only pure-nonlinear minimal-leaf coefficients. It does not cover the root box, heat terms, or the infinite Taylor tail, and it does not prove global regularity or finite-time singularity for the three-dimensional Navier–Stokes equations.",
  "两个点不能证明有界或次二次增长。": "Two points cannot prove bounded or subquadratic growth.",
  "两个输入的尖锐方向投影、纵向 jet 以及对称根相互作用都精确非零。": "The sharp-direction projections and longitudinal jets of both inputs, as well as the symmetrized root interaction, are all exactly nonzero.",
  "目标位于支持立方体的极端面": "The target lies on an extreme face of the support cube",
  "全空间二次增益": "the full-space quadratic gain",
  "任何离开 \\(m_2=-L\\) 的历史都不能回到最小叶目标。": "No history that leaves \\(m_2=-L\\) can return to a minimal-leaf target.",
  "任意 \\(L\\) 个立方体顶点之和满足 \\(m_2\\ge-L\\)。R0.22 的 \\(a_N,b_N,a_N+b_N\\) 在各自最小叶数上都满足等号。": "Any sum of \\(L\\) cube vertices satisfies \\(m_2\\ge-L\\). The R0.22 labels \\(a_N,b_N,a_N+b_N\\) attain equality at their respective minimal leaf counts.",
  "三个 \\(N=2\\) 二次域系数逐项一致。": "The three \\(N=2\\) quadratic-field coefficients agree component by component.",
  "十六阶的面容量是 \\(18^2=324\\)，精确聚合后有 320 个非零标签；全立方体容量则是 \\(18^3=5832\\)。": "At order sixteen the face capacity is \\(18^2=324\\), with 320 nonzero labels after exact aggregation; the full cube capacity is \\(18^3=5832\\).",
  "算术：GMP 二次域精确有理数": "Arithmetic: exact GMP rationals over a quadratic field",
  "所有 \\(N\\) 的上界": "An upper bound for every \\(N\\)",
  "我利用一个极端面选择律，把十六阶完整目标系数化为闭合二维递推。尖锐方向仍精确出现，但真实增益保持在 \\(0.36156\\)；相对全空间尖锐基准的比例继续下降。": "I use an extreme-face selection rule to reduce the full order-16 target coefficient to a closed two-dimensional recurrence. The sharp direction still appears exactly, but the generated gain remains at \\(0.36156\\), and its ratio to the full-space sharp benchmark continues to fall.",
  "选择律": "selection rule",
  "研究笔记 R0.24 · 最小叶边界面": "Research note R0.24 · minimal-leaf boundary face",
  "研究笔记 R0.24：利用最小叶极端面选择律，精确计算 N=3 尖锐标签的 8、7、16 阶系数。": "Research note R0.24: an extreme-face selection rule for exact computation of the order-8, order-7, and order-16 coefficients at the N=3 sharp labels.",
