  "在计算 \\(N=3\\) 前，我把边界递推跑到十阶，并与完整 R0.23 证书比较。\\(U_5(2,-6,4)\\)、\\(U_4(-1,-5,-5)\\) 和 \\(U_{10}(1,-11,-1)\\) 的所有二次域基坐标完全一致。": "Before computing \\(N=3\\), I run the boundary recurrence through order ten and compare it with the full R0.23 certificate. Every quadratic-field coordinate of \\(U_5(2,-6,4)\\), \\(U_4(-1,-5,-5)\\), and \\(U_{10}(1,-11,-1)\\) agrees exactly.",
