  "，记录两套精度、所有根分裂、通道重构误差、R0.24 回归和运行环境。": ", recording both precisions, every root split, channel-reconstruction errors, the R0.24 regression, and the runtime environment.",
  "\\(\\sigma_m\\) 才是进入二次障碍的尖锐坐标。一个模式的横向部分可以与尖锐方向高度对齐，但只要完整范数由纵向 jet 主导，\\(\\sigma_m\\) 仍然很小。对当前两个输入，\\(|\\lambda_m|\\le25/24\\)。": "\\(\\sigma_m\\) is the sharp coordinate that enters the quadratic obstruction. A mode's transverse part may be strongly aligned with the sharp direction, yet \\(\\sigma_m\\) remains small when the full norm is dominated by the longitudinal jet. For the two inputs here, \\(|\\lambda_m|\\le25/24\\).",
  "\\(a_N\\) 主导分裂 / 完整系数": "dominant \\(a_N\\) split / full coefficient",
