  "R0.26：边缘约化与三叶传递的负面检验": "R0.26: edge reduction and the negative three-leaf transfer test",
  "，记录端点窗口、两套精度、传递矩阵、带符号余项、R0.25 回归和运行环境。": ", recording the endpoint window, both precisions, transfer matrices, signed remainders, R0.25 regression, and runtime environment.",
  "\\(\\rho(T_N)\\to24t\\approx11.90>1\\)，余项也不是小扰动。": "\\(\\rho(T_N)\\to24t\\approx11.90>1\\), and the remainder is not a small perturbation.",
  "\\(b_N\\) 是精确边缘系数；\\(a_N\\) 是另一条边缘的两个一阶变分之和。": "\\(b_N\\) is an exact edge coefficient; \\(a_N\\) is the sum of two first variations of the opposite edge.",
  "\\(N\\le25\\) 双精度审计": "Dual-precision audit for \\(N\\le25\\)",
  "\\(R_N\\) 是后三次递推展开中至少出现一次非一叶根分裂的全部项之带符号和。在尖锐—纵向坐标中，直接展开给出": "\\(R_N\\) is the signed sum of all terms in which at least one of the last three recurrence expansions has a non-one-leaf root split. Direct expansion in sharp-longitudinal coordinates gives",
  "\\(t=0.4958758920134925\\ldots\\)，所以两个极限谱半径都是 \\(24t=11.9010214083238\\ldots\\)。孤立三叶传递不是收缩映射，不能按 R0.25 预想的方式传播小的 \\(N|\\sigma|\\)。": "\\(t=0.4958758920134925\\ldots\\), so both limiting spectral radii equal \\(24t=11.9010214083238\\ldots\\). The isolated three-leaf transfer is not contractive and cannot propagate small \\(N|\\sigma|\\) in the manner proposed in R0.25.",
