  "递推每隔三个叶阶穿过 \\(Q=0\\)。这里不能把第一式中的 \\(\\mathcal Q^{-1}\\) 形式延拓过去，必须使用单独的 \\(\\mathcal L^{-1}\\) 投影项。后续奇点分析需要同时控制这条共振切片。": "Recursion every three leaf stages passes through \\(Q=0\\). Here, I cannot extend the form of \\(\\mathcal Q^{-1}\\) in the first equation; a separate \\(\\mathcal L^{-1}\\) projection term must be used. Subsequent singularity analysis requires simultaneous control over this resonant slice.",
