  "继续阅读 R0.28：无根号递推与有限比值分离 →": "Continue to R0.28: radical-free recurrence and finite ratio separation →",
  "经典奇点分析和多变量解析组合学提供了从奇点到系数渐近的成熟工具，但当前非线性方程并不能直接套用现成定理。零电荷投影和形式 PDE 必须先化成可验证的解析对象。": "Classical singularity analysis and analytic combinatorics in several variables provide mature tools for passing from singularities to coefficient asymptotics, but no existing theorem applies directly to the present nonlinear equations. The zero-charge projection and formal PDE must first be turned into verifiable analytic objects.",
  "精确标量生成方程、不可忽略的零电荷投影，以及 N=2 至 75 的双精度端点审计。": "Exact scalar generating equations, the essential zero-charge projection, and a two-precision endpoint audit from N=2 through 75.",
  "两套 MPFR 结果的最大相对差为 \\(3.21\\times10^{-43}\\)。": "The maximum relative difference between two MPFR results is \\(3.21\\times10^{-43}\\).",
