  "每个四分量系数由纵向标量 \\(\\alpha\\) 与尖锐标量 \\(s\\) 唯一决定。": "Each four-component coefficient is uniquely determined by the longitudinal scalar \\(\\alpha\\) and sharp scalar \\(s\\).",
