  "若 \\(\\Pi_0\\) 投影到整数电荷 \\(Q=0\\) 的单项式，完整标量递推等价于": "If \\(\\Pi_0\\) projects onto monomials of integer charge \\(Q=0\\), the complete scalar recurrence is equivalent to",
