  "双变量生成方程": "bivariate generating equation",
  "提取已知叶单项式，把标量递推改写成精确有理数递推，消除 MPFR 舍入对符号问题的影响。": "Factor out the known leaf monomials and rewrite the scalar recurrence over exact rationals, eliminating the effect of MPFR rounding on the sign question.",
  "图 R0.27-1。左图给出 \\((-1)^N\\sigma_{B,N}\\)；右图给出 \\(1-|\\sigma_{B,N}|\\) 与 \\(|L\\alpha/s|\\) 的对数尺度诊断。阴影只标记 \\(N=56\\) 至 75 的描述性拟合窗口，不代表已证明的渐近区间。": "Figure R0.27-1. The left panel shows \\((-1)^N\\sigma_{B,N}\\); the right panel shows \\(1-|\\sigma_{B,N}|\\) and \\(|L\\alpha/s|\\) on a logarithmic scale. The shading only marks the descriptive fit window from \\(N=56\\) through 75; it is not a proved asymptotic regime.",
  "完整递推等价于一个带零电荷投影的非线性方程和一个线性输运方程。": "The complete recursion is equivalent to a nonlinear equation with zero-charge projection and a linear transport equation.",
  "我把 R0.26 的负边缘递推精确降成两个标量生成方程。电荷一端点计算到 \\(N=75\\) 后，有限窗口显示 \\(|\\sigma_{B,N}|\\) 接近一，而不是按 \\(N^{-1}\\) 变小。": "I reduce the negative-edge recurrence from R0.26 exactly to two scalar generating equations. With the charge-one endpoint computed through \\(N=75\\), the finite window shows \\(|\\sigma_{B,N}|\\) approaching one rather than decreasing like \\(N^{-1}\\).",
  "下一步先做精确符号与增长率界": "Next: exact signs and growth-ratio bounds",
