  "研究笔记 R0.27 · 生成方程": "research note R0.27 · generating equation",
  "研究笔记 R0.27：把精确负边缘递推标量化为双变量生成方程，并以 160/224 位 MPFR 检验电荷一端点到 N=75。": "Research note R0.27: scalarizing the exact negative-edge recurrence into bivariate generating equations and testing the charge-one endpoint through N=75 with 160/224-bit MPFR arithmetic.",
  "一个非线性方程加一个线性输运方程": "One nonlinear equation plus one linear transport equation",
  "因此只需追踪 \\(\\alpha_{n,k}\\) 与 \\(s_{n,k}\\)。R0.26 的端点满足": "Therefore, only track \\(\\alpha_{n,k}\\) and \\(s_{n,k}\\). R0.26's endpoints satisfy",
  "有限表支持 \\(|\\sigma_{B,N}|\\to1\\)，但尚无严格的系数渐近定理。": "The finite table supports \\(|\\sigma_{B,N}|\\to1\\), but no rigorous coefficient-asymptotic theorem is available yet.",
  "有限序列总能与某种更晚出现的衰减相容，所以这张表不能严格否定 \\(O(N^{-1})\\)。它能否定的是原有数值判断：\\(N=2\\) 至 5 的小常数不是稳定趋势。": "A finite sequence is always compatible with decay beginning later, so this table cannot rigorously rule out \\(O(N^{-1})\\). What it does rule out is the earlier numerical judgment: the small constants from \\(N=2\\) through 5 are not a stable trend.",
  "原来在 \\((n,k)\\) 平面漂移的端点现在变成固定电荷抽取：": "The endpoint that drifted in the \\((n,k)\\)-plane now becomes a fixed-charge coefficient extraction:",
  "再令 \\(X=z\\partial_z\\)、\\(Y=w\\partial_w\\)、\\(\\mathcal L=X+Y\\)、\\(\\mathcal Q=2Y-X\\)，以及": "Let \\(X=z\\partial_z\\), \\(Y=w\\partial_w\\), \\(\\mathcal L=X+Y\\), and \\(\\mathcal Q=2Y-X\\),",
  "在端点 \\(Q=1\\) 上，归一化尖锐坐标为": "at the endpoint \\(Q=1\\), the normalized sharp coordinate is",
  "这把下一步精确化为一个系数渐近问题：比较固定电荷一上 \\(A\\) 与 \\(S\\) 的主导奇点和增长率。": "This turns the next step into a precise coefficient-asymptotic problem: compare the dominant singularities and growth rates of \\(A\\) and \\(S\\) at fixed charge one.",
  "正式证书保存全部 \\(N=2\\) 至 75 端点、零电荷射线、双精度差、尾部拟合、软件环境和源提交。内部使用每叶 \\(4^{-1}\\) 的指数缩放；\\(\\sigma\\) 与 \\(s/(L\\alpha)\\) 对该缩放不变。": "The formal certificate records every endpoint from \\(N=2\\) through 75, the zero-charge ray, the two-precision differences, tail fits, software environment, and source commit. The implementation uses an exponential factor of \\(4^{-1}\\) per leaf; \\(\\sigma\\) and \\(s/(L\\alpha)\\) are invariant under this scaling.",
  "证明 \\((-1)^N\\) 扭转后的最终符号规律，或用区间证书给出反例。": "Prove the eventual sign pattern after the \\((-1)^N\\) twist, or give a counterexample with an interval certificate.",
  "证明任一命题，都会使这组初值上的“一半径小极化”证明路线失效。它不会证明 Navier–Stokes 爆破，而是给出一个严格的路线排除结果。": "Proving either statement would invalidate the one-radius small-polarization proof route for these initial data. It would not prove Navier–Stokes blow-up; it would give a rigorous route-exclusion result.",
