  "R0.25 证明：若两个端点尖锐坐标都是 \\(O(N^{-1})\\)，危险生成增益便一致有界。现在 \\(b_N\\) 一侧显示相反的有限行为：到 \\(N=75\\)，\\(N|\\sigma_{B,N}|=74.9834\\)，且 \\(|\\sigma_{B,N}|\\) 已接近一。": "R0.25 proves that if both endpoint sharp coordinates are \\(O(N^{-1})\\), the dangerous generated gain is uniformly bounded. The finite behavior on the \\(b_N\\) side is now the opposite: at \\(N=75\\), \\(N|\\sigma_{B,N}|=74.9834\\) and \\(|\\sigma_{B,N}|\\) is already close to one.",
