  "版本 v0.28 · 2026-08-18": "version v0.28 · 2026-08-18",
  "本次结果能够严格排除三个疑问：R0.27 的趋势不是 MPFR 舍入造成的，不依赖根式生成元 \\(t\\)，也不是选取单个舍入参数点造成的。它还提示一个明确机制：尖锐系列看起来具有更近的负实奇点，而纵向系列看起来具有更远的正实奇点。后一句仍是待证明的解析解释。": "The present result rigorously removes three possible artifacts: the R0.27 trend is not caused by MPFR rounding, does not depend on the radical generator \\(t\\), and is not an artifact of selecting one rounded parameter point. It also suggests a concrete mechanism: the sharp series appears to have a nearer negative-real singularity, whereas the longitudinal series appears to have a more distant positive-real singularity. This last sentence remains an unproved analytic interpretation.",
  "比值": "ratio",
  "变量代换与有理递推是全阶恒等式。\\(N\\le40\\) 的符号和连续比值是精确有限定理。这里没有证明 \\(|\\sigma_{B,N}|\\to1\\)，也没有得到三维 Navier–Stokes 正则性或有限时奇性的结论。": "The change of variables and rational recurrence are all-order identities. The signs and consecutive ratios for \\(N\\le40\\) are exact finite theorems. Nothing here proves \\(|\\sigma_{B,N}|\\to1\\), three-dimensional Navier–Stokes regularity, or finite-time singularity formation.",
  "从 \\(N=8\\) 到 40，中心值相对根盒不确定度的最小倍数为 \\(62214.5105\\)。有限符号结论远离区间边界。": "From \\(N=8\\) through 40, the smallest ratio of the center value to the root-box uncertainty is \\(62214.5105\\). Thus every certified finite sign lies far from its interval boundary.",
  "当前证书只覆盖 \\(N=18\\) 至 40 的比值分离。有限表不能证明收敛半径，更不能排除更晚发生的反转。": "The current certificate covers ratio separation only from \\(N=18\\) through 40. A finite table cannot determine a convergence radius or exclude a later reversal.",
  "端点尖锐坐标精确化为": "The endpoint sharp coordinate becomes exactly",
  "对根分裂，记 \\(L=n+k\\)、\\(Q=3k-L\\) 与 \\(\\Delta=n_1k_2-k_1n_2\\)。有理数组满足": "for root splitting, denote \\(L=n+k\\), \\(Q=3k-L\\), and \\(\\Delta=n_1k_2-k_1n_2\\). Rational arrays satisfy",
  "对盒中每个 \\((p,q)\\) 和全部 \\(8\\le N\\le40\\)，有 \\((-1)^{N+1}d_N(p,q)>0\\)。": "For every \\((p,q)\\) in the box and every \\(8\\le N\\le40\\), one has \\((-1)^{N+1}d_N(p,q)>0\\).",
  "对任意 \\(p,q\\)，尖锐数组精确写成 \\(d=pu+qv\\)。": "For arbitrary \\(p,q\\), the sharp array is exactly \\(d=pu+qv\\).",
  "对应的生成方程为": "the corresponding generating equation is",
  "对整个根盒和每个 \\(18\\le N\\le40\\)，精确区间都满足": "For the entire root box and every \\(18\\le N\\le40\\), the exact intervals satisfy",
  "浮点疑问已排除，渐近定理仍未完成": "floating-point doubts have been excluded, but asymptotic theorem remains unfinished",
