  "构造包含零电荷切片及相邻电荷扇区的不变锥，证明 \\(a_N>0\\)、\\((-1)^{N+1}d_N>0\\) 与 \\(\\Gamma_N\\ge1+\\varepsilon\\) 最终统一成立；": "construct an invariant cone containing the zero-charge slice and adjacent charge sectors, and prove that \\(a_N>0\\), \\((-1)^{N+1}d_N>0\\), and \\(\\Gamma_N\\ge1+\\varepsilon\\) all hold eventually;",
  "继而由尖锐坐标公式得到 \\(|\\sigma_{B,N}|\\to1\\)。若奇偶符号也最终保持，则 \\(\\sigma_{B,N}\\) 的符号为 \\((-1)^N\\)。": "Then the sharp-coordinate formula gives \\(|\\sigma_{B,N}|\\to1\\). If the parity sign also persists eventually, the sign of \\(\\sigma_{B,N}\\) is \\((-1)^N\\).",
  "继续增加有限表的长度已经不是主要困难。下一项工作必须产生下面两种结果之一：": "Extending the finite table is no longer the main difficulty. The next step must produce one of two outcomes:",
