  "我消去了负边缘递推中的根式与生成元，把端点写成三个有理数数组。整个认证根盒上，奇偶符号在 \\(8\\le N\\le40\\) 成立，尖锐系数比从 \\(N=18\\) 到 40 持续占优。": "I removed the radicals and their generator from the negative-edge recurrence, reducing the endpoint to three rational arrays. Throughout the certified root box, the parity signs hold for \\(8\\le N\\le40\\), and the sharp-series coefficient ratio is uniformly smaller from \\(N=18\\) through 40.",
