  "用这些有理数重建的 \\(\\sigma_{B,N}\\) 与 \\(d_N/((3N-1)a_N)\\)，在 \\(N\\le25\\) 上与 R0.27 证书逐项一致。": "Reconstructing \\(\\sigma_{B,N}\\) and \\(d_N/((3N-1)a_N)\\) from these rationals agrees term by term with the R0.27 certificate for \\(N\\le25\\).",
