  "这段完整窗口中最小的下界是 \\(\\Gamma_{19}>1.0294319301\\)。在更稳定的 \\(N=29\\) 至 40 尾段，统一区间为": "the minimum lower bound in this complete window is \\(\\Gamma_{19}>1.0294319301\\). In the more stable \\(N=29\\) to 40 tail segment, unified intervals are",
