  "这里的负号来自端点含有奇数个负泵叶。参数 \\(x\\) 与根式 \\(t\\) 已完全消失。": "the negative sign comes from endpoints containing an odd number of negative pump leaves. Parameter \\(x\\) and root element \\(t\\) have completely disappeared.",
  "整个根盒上的符号与比值": "entire root box signs and ratios",
  "正式证书保存 \\(N=1\\) 至 40 的全部 \\(a_N,u_N,v_N,d_N\\) 分数、根盒区间、连续比值、摘要界、R0.27 回归、软件环境和源提交。计算共处理 5,484,501 个有序标量相互作用。": "The formal certificate records, from \\(N=1\\) through 40, every fraction \\(a_N,u_N,v_N,d_N\\), the root-box intervals, consecutive ratios, summary bounds, the R0.27 regression, the software environment, and the source commit. The computation evaluates 5,484,501 ordered scalar interactions.",
  "证书": "certificate",
  "只有完成其中一项，才适合进入真正的主导奇点与系数转移分析。经典奇点分析说明如何从已证明的局部奇点展开得到系数渐近，但不会把有限比值表自动升级为定理。": "only one of these is suitable for entering true dominant singularities and coefficient transfer analysis. Classical singularity analysis explains how to obtain asymptotic coefficients from local expansions but does not automatically upgrade finite ratio tables into theorems.",
  "状态 · 全阶恒等式 + 有限精确证书": "Status · all-order identities + finite exact certificate",
  "最高叶数：119": "highest leaf number: 119",
  "最终符号与主导奇点": "final signs and dominant singularities",
  "GMP 计算到 \\(N=40\\)，即最高 119 叶，得到：": "The GMP computation reaches \\(N=40\\), or 119 leaves, and gives:",
  "R0.20 给出中心 \\((p_*,q_*)\\) 与半径 \\(10^{-6}\\) 的认证盒。因为 \\(u_N,v_N\\) 都是有理数，下面的包含关系也是精确有理数区间：": "R0.20 gives center \\((p_*,q_*)\\) and radius \\(10^{-6}\\) of the certification box. Because all \\(u_N,v_N\\) are rational numbers, the following inclusion relations are also exact rational number intervals:",
  "R0.27 的首层为": "R0.27's first layer is",
  "R0.27：标量生成方程与端点极化": "R0.27: scalar generating equation and endpoint polarization",
  "R0.28 · 全阶恒等式与有限证书分开记录": "R0.28 · full-order identity and finite certificate recorded separately",
  "R0.28 根盒上的精确连续系数半径代理与相对增长因子": "Exact consecutive coefficient-radius proxies and relative growth factors on the R0.28 root box",
  "R0.28｜有理化与有限比值分离": "R0.28｜rationalization and finite ratio separation",
  "“弱解不唯一”“存在粗糙自相似解”“数值计算出现高涡量增长”都不等价于 “某个光滑初值的经典解有限时爆破”。记录这类结果时，我会同时写出初值正则性、能量不等式、适当性、外力和解类。": "Nonuniqueness of weak solutions, rough self-similar solutions, and numerical growth of vorticity do not imply finite-time blow-up of a classical solution from smooth initial data. When I record such a result, I also state the regularity of the initial data, the energy inequality, suitability, forcing, and solution class.",
  "《基础约定 v1》：方程、Leray 投影、函数空间、缩放表、引用规范。": "The basic conventions v1: equations, Leray projection, function spaces, scaling table, reference style.",
  "\\(-\\Delta p=\\partial_i\\partial_j(u_i u_j)\\)。局部速度结构会通过 Riesz 变换影响远处，局部化估计产生压力尾项。": "\\(-\\Delta p=\\partial_i\\partial_j(u_i u_j)\\). A local velocity structure can affect distant regions through the Riesz transforms, and localized estimates therefore acquire pressure tails.",
  "\\(\\int(S\\omega)\\cdot\\omega\\) 既可能衰减也可能增长；粗略取绝对值会丢掉可能决定正则性的几何抵消。": "\\(\\int(S\\omega)\\cdot\\omega\\) may decay or grow; roughly taking absolute values would discard possible geometric cancellations determining regularity.",
  "\\(\\sup_{t\\le T}\\|u(t)\\|_{L^3}\\) 或等价临界控制对每个有限 \\(T\\) 有界。": "\\(\\sup_{t\\le T}\\|u(t)\\|_{L^3}\\) or equivalent critical control is bounded for each finite \\(T\\).",
  "\\(BMO^{-1}\\) 小数据与 \\(L^\\infty L^3\\) 端点": "\\(BMO^{-1}\\) small-data and \\(L^\\infty L^3\\) endpoint",
  "\\(L^2\\) 能量可以在越来越高的频率上以越来越小的代价存在，因此总能量有界不排除高频集中。": "\\(L^2\\) energy can exist at increasingly higher frequencies with decreasing cost, so bounded total energy does not exclude high-frequency concentration.",
  "\\(N=2\\) 的两个输入标签第一次出现在 5 阶与 4 阶，输出第一次出现在 10 阶。 两个输入对 R0.22 尖锐横向方向的投影都精确非零，对称根相互作用也不精确抵消。 但实际归一化增益为 \\(0.3045602145\\ldots\\)，只相当于同标签专门尖锐极化的 \\(0.0043346408\\ldots\\)。": "For \\(N=2\\), the two input labels first appear at orders five and four, and the output first appears at order ten. Both inputs have exactly nonzero projections onto the sharp transverse direction from R0.22, and the two symmetric root interactions do not cancel exactly. The actual normalized gain is \\(0.3045602145\\ldots\\), only \\(0.0043346408\\ldots\\) times the gain from the specially chosen sharp polarization with the same label.",
  "\\(N=3\\) 的 8 阶与 7 阶输入仍有精确非零的尖锐方向投影，对称根相互作用也不为零。 真实归一化增益从 \\(N=2\\) 的 \\(0.304560\\) 略升到 \\(0.361556\\)， 但真实/尖锐比降到 \\(0.00195675\\)，半径乘积归一化增益约减半。": "The order-8 and order-7 inputs at \\(N=3\\) still have exactly nonzero sharp-direction projections, and the symmetrized root interaction is also nonzero. From its \\(N=2\\) value of \\(0.304560\\), the generated normalized gain rises slightly to \\(0.361556\\), but the generated/sharp ratio falls to \\(0.00195675\\), while the radius-product-normalized gain is roughly halved.",
  "\\(u:\\Omega\\times[0,\\infty)\\to\\mathbb R^3\\) 是速度，\\(p\\) 是压力，\\(\\nu>0\\) 是黏性系数。": "\\(u:\\Omega\\times[0,\\infty)\\to\\mathbb R^3\\) is velocity, \\(p\\) is pressure, \\(\\nu>0\\) is viscosity coefficient.",
