  "160 位与 224 位 MPFR 约化递推计算到 \\(N=25\\)。 \\(N|\\sigma_A|\\) 在 \\(N=21\\) 达到 \\(18.8124\\)，生成增益在 \\(N=25\\) 达到 \\(1620.26\\)。 这不能单独否定渐近 \\(O(N^{-1})\\)，但已经否定了从 \\(N=2\\) 至 5 的小常数直接外推。": "The 160-bit and 224-bit MPFR reduced recurrences reach \\(N=25\\). \\(N|\\sigma_A|\\) at \\(N=21\\) reaches \\(18.8124\\), and the generated gain at \\(N=25\\) reaches \\(1620.26\\). This alone cannot disprove asymptotic \\(O(N^{-1})\\), but it does refute direct extrapolation of the small constant from \\(N=2\\) through 5.",
  "2025 年提交、2026 年修订的一篇预印本": "A preprint submitted in 2025 and revised in 2026",
  "八个 signed 初始频率在有理 charge–offset 坐标下恰好构成一个线性变换立方体。 因而 \\(L\\) 叶支持精确含 \\((L+1)^3\\) 个标签；偶数 \\(L\\) 去掉零频后少一个。 不可压缩恒等式与纵向半范数同时消除了表面上的 \\(4^n\\) 壳层损失。": "In rational charge–offset coordinates, the eight signed initial frequencies form an exact linear image of a cube. The support with \\(L\\) leaves therefore contains exactly \\((L+1)^3\\) labels, or one fewer when \\(L\\) is even and the zero frequency is removed. The incompressibility identity and the longitudinal seminorm together remove the apparent \\(4^n\\) shell loss.",
  "把 R0.8 极化沿 \\(M\\) 输运并固定每壳 \\(\\dot H^{1/2}\\) 能量后， 下一壳目标对的最大第一 Picard 能量满足 \\(4^{5j}H_j\\to81/(173056\\sqrt3)\\)。 一般的频率壳估计还给出 \\(m_N/N^3\\) 上界，其中 \\(m_N\\) 是每个输出的输入配对重数。": "Polarize R0.8 along the \\(M\\) transport and fix each shell \\(\\dot H^{1/2}\\) energy, then the maximum first Picard energy of the next shell target satisfies \\(4^{5j}H_j\\to81/(173056\\sqrt3)\\). General frequency shell estimates also provide an upper bound on \\(m_N/N^3\\), where \\(m_N\\) is the multiplicity of each input pair for output.",
  "把已知结果、预印本、计算、猜想和失败尝试分开写。": "Distinguish known results, preprints, computations, conjectures, and failed attempts.",
  "半群方法和尺度临界空间逐渐形成现代适定性框架。": "The semigroup method and scale-critical spaces gradually form a modern well-posedness framework.",
  "保留 Fourier 反例、常数失控或端点失败的具体计算。": "Keep Fourier counterexamples, constant loss of control or endpoint failures in specific calculations.",
  "保留一份可以逐行检查的 HTML/PDF 笔记，并列出已经被小算例排除的普适估计。": "Keep an HTML/PDF notebook that can be checked line by line, listing general estimates that have been excluded by small examples.",
  "泵与催化圆锥参数分离后，比值降到 \\(15.8014436197\\ldots\\)；邻近整洁点的五维联合 Hessian 由精确主子式证明正定。": "After separating pump and catalytic cone parameters, the ratio drops to \\(15.8014436197\\ldots\\); a five-dimensional joint Hessian near the clean point is proven positive definite by exact principal minors.",
  "边界面极化通道约化": "Boundary-face polarization-channel reduction",
  "边缘/一阶缺陷闭包和传递极限是严格结论；\\(N\\le25\\) 的放大是有限高精度证据。 下一项将分析精确边缘生成函数的主导奇点，判断尖锐比究竟趋向非零值还是按可证明的速率衰减。": "The edge/first-defect closure and transfer limits are rigorous; the growth for \\(N\\le25\\) is finite high-precision evidence. The next item will analyze the dominant singularity of the exact edge generating function and determine whether the sharp ratio tends to a nonzero value or decays at a provable rate.",
  "边缘约化与三叶传递的负面检验": "Edge reduction and the negative three-leaf transfer test",
  "标量化和生成方程是严格形式恒等式；\\(N\\le75\\) 的趋势仍是有限高精度证据。 尚未证明主导奇点、最终符号或 \\(|\\sigma_{B,N}|\\) 的极限，也没有得到 Navier–Stokes 正则性结论。": "The scalarization and generating equations are exact formal identities; the trend through \\(N\\le75\\) remains finite high-precision evidence. The dominant singularity, eventual sign, and limit of \\(|\\sigma_{B,N}|\\) have not been proved, and no Navier–Stokes regularity conclusion has been obtained.",
  "标量生成方程与固定电荷端点": "Scalar generating equations and the fixed-charge endpoint",
