  "先研究的情形": "Initial study case",
  "显式下界很不锋利，Hessian 仍是浮点审计，稠密包也没有随 \\(N\\) 和锥宽统一的 PDE 估计。": "The explicit lower bound is not sharp, the Hessian remains a floating-point audit, and dense packets are not included with \\(N\\) and PDE estimates that unify cone width.",
  "现有的全局控制量位于超临界尺度，而已知正则性判据需要临界或更强的控制。下面是我反复遇到的四个问题。": "The existing global control quantities are at supercritical scales, while known regularity criteria require critical or stronger controls. Below are four issues I repeatedly encounter.",
  "相互作用核公式、对称性清单、最坏三波族、候选不等式反例库。": "Interaction kernel formula, symmetry list, worst triad family, candidate inequality counterexamples library.",
  "写出 Fourier 系数方程 \\[ \\partial_t\\widehat u(k)+\\nu|k|^2\\widehat u(k) =-i\\!\\!\\sum_{p+q=k}\\!(q\\cdot\\widehat u(p))\\,\\mathbb P_k\\widehat u(q), \\] 并核对实值、无散与三波能量交换对称性。": "Write the Fourier coefficient equation \\[ \\partial_t\\widehat u(k)+\\nu|k|^2\\widehat u(k) =-i\\!\\!\\sum_{p+q=k}\\!(q\\cdot\\widehat u(p))\\,\\mathbb P_k\\widehat u(q), \\] and check real-valued, divergence-free, and three-wave energy exchange symmetries.",
  "需要分开看的几件事": "Several things that need to be considered separately",
  "压力非局部": "Nonlocal pressure",
  "严格结论": "Strict conclusion",
  "严格局部极小只属于所选四个实极化图坐标与振幅比组成的五变量第五阶模型； 其他正参数根、边界族、复相位、Taylor 余项和 PDE 动力学仍未关闭。": "Strict local minimizers only belong to the five-variable fifth-order model selected from four real polarization graph coordinates and amplitude ratios; other positive parameters, boundary families, complex phases, Taylor remainders, and PDE dynamics are still not closed.",
