  "一般解是否自动获得这种相干性未知。": "Generally, it is unknown whether the general solution automatically obtains such coherence.",
  "一个必要的对照": "a necessary control case",
  "一个解析 2D3C 候选显著降低法向泄漏，并延长有限维临界增长。": "a parsing 2D3C candidate significantly reduces normal leakage and extends finite-dimensional critical growth.",
  "一个精确同号电荷模式族满足输入与输出解析半径完全可加； 有序相互作用除以 \\(N^2\\) 趋于 \\(27/2\\)，对称二次相互作用趋于 \\(27\\)。 同一族上的无量纲热率只趋于 \\(1/12,1/12,1/3\\)，不能支付 \\(N^2\\) 损失。": "a precise same-sign charge mode family satisfies input and output analytic radii fully additive; ordered interactions divided by \\(N^2\\) tend to \\(27/2\\), symmetric quadratic interactions tend to \\(27\\). The dimensionless heat rate on the same family only tends to \\(1/12,1/12,1/3\\) and cannot pay for \\(N^2\\) loss.",
  "一个四叶临界包达到 \\(N^3\\) 配对阈值，并把第一代输出集中到跨壳目标；中心映射的一维极化像同时给出新的迭代障碍。": "a four-leaf critical packet reaches \\(N^3\\) pairing threshold, focusing first-generation output onto trans-shell targets; the one-dimensional polarization of the central mapping simultaneously provides a new iterative obstruction.",
  "依照 Clay 规则，需在合格出版物发表并经过规定的接受与等待过程。": "According to Clay rules, it must be published in a qualified journal and undergo the prescribed acceptance and waiting process.",
  "已知结果": "know results",
  "已知困难": "know difficulties",
  "翼门系数 \\(h_n=\\sqrt3\\,4^n/\\sqrt{2\\cdot16^n+1}\\) 与跨壳门系数 \\(g_n\\) 都趋于 \\(\\sqrt{3/2}\\)， 所以中心接力没有壳层退化。 但是生成模态的反向作用会离开原来的一维极化线；显式线外缺陷趋于 \\(3/(2\\sqrt2)\\)，约为前向门的 \\(86.6\\%\\)。": "wing gate coefficient \\(h_n=\\sqrt3\\,4^n/\\sqrt{2\\cdot16^n+1}\\) with cross-shell gate coefficients \\(g_n\\) tend to \\(\\sqrt{3/2}\\), therefore the central relay does not exhibit shell degeneration. However, the reverse action of generated modes tends to leave the original one-dimensional polarized line; explicit line exterior defects tend to \\(3/(2\\sqrt2)\\), approximately the forward door's \\(86.6\\%\\).",
  "因而任意复催化振幅的全局极小值精确等于 \\(45.73934896472748\\ldots\\)，等号恰在等幅同相轨道达到。 随后把四个实输入极化的切向导数直接传播到完整第五阶树，得到单位角梯度 \\((-35.3079,35.3079,-27.3318,27.3318)\\)。固定 R0.11 极化不是该比值的驻点。": "therefore the global minimum of any complex catalytic amplitude is precisely equal to \\(45.73934896472748\\ldots\\), with equality holding exactly when the amplitudes are in phase and identical. subsequently the tangential derivatives of the four real input polarizations are directly propagated to the complete fifth-order tree, yielding a unit angular gradient \\((-35.3079,35.3079,-27.3318,27.3318)\\). fixing R0.11 polarization is not an extremum for this ratio.",
  "因而只优化两组反对称角会漏掉一个严格下降方向。 我又取有理参数 \\(m=28/155\\)、\\(n=7/25\\)、\\(x=5377/5000\\)， 对 332 个聚合频率作精确比较，得到外部/目标比 \\(18.035985268234917\\ldots\\)，目标能量比例为 \\(5.2532085201\\ldots\\%\\)。": "therefore optimizing only two groups of asymmetric angles would lead to a loss of a strictly decreasing direction. i then took rational parameters \\(m=28/155\\), \\(n=7/25\\), and \\(x=5377/5000\\) for the precise comparison of 332 aggregated frequencies, obtaining an external/target ratio \\(18.035985268234917\\ldots\\), with a target energy proportion of \\(5.2532085201\\ldots\\%\\).",
  "用途": "purpose",
  "由 Hou–Wang–Yang 主张给出": "By the claim of Hou–Wang–Yang",
  "由此得到一个一般 \\(N\\ge2\\) 的条件不等式：只要两个归一化尖锐坐标都是 \\(O(N^{-1})\\)，真实生成增益就一致有界。 160 位与 224 位 MPFR 递推进一步计算到 \\(N=5\\)；四个点的 \\(N|\\sigma|\\) 都低于 \\(0.214\\)，生成增益都低于 \\(0.422\\)。": "This gives a conditional inequality for every \\(N\\ge2\\): if both normalized sharp coordinates are \\(O(N^{-1})\\), the generated gain is uniformly bounded. The 160-bit and 224-bit MPFR recurrences extend the calculation to \\(N=5\\); at all four points, \\(N|\\sigma|\\) is below \\(0.214\\), and the generated gain is below \\(0.422\\).",
