  "R0.6 解析候选的约束 Hessian 在去掉两个平移方向后数值正定。 但完整中心空间都属于 \\(k_3=0\\) 的 2D3C 类，因而分裂成二维 Navier–Stokes 与被动标量，中心模型本身全局正则。": "R0.6 The candidate constraint Hessian, after removing two translation directions, is numerically positive definite. However, the entire central space belongs to the 2D3C class of \\(k_3=0\\), thus splitting into two-dimensional Navier–Stokes and a passive scalar; the central model itself is globally regular.",
